{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-02b65978", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2208.12095 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2208.12095 measures the following observables:\n\n- Dilepton (leptonic) charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\text{C}}^{\\ell\\bar{\\ell}} \\)\n- Top-quark pair charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\text{C}}^{t\\bar{t}} \\)\n\nThese observables are recorded in the paper with the following IDs:\n- `hepkg:observable:AC_llbar`\n- `hepkg:observable:AC_ttbar`\n\nThis information is supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n- For \\( A_{\\text{C}}^{\\ell\\bar{\\ell}} \\): \"Dilepton (leptonic) charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\text{C}}^{\\ell\\bar{\\ell}} \\)\"\n- For \\( A_{\\text{C}}^{t\\bar{t}} \\): \"Top-quark pair charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\text{C}}^{t\\bar{t}} \\)\"\n\nTherefore, the analysis 2208.12095 measures these two observables.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2208.12095 measures the following observables:\\n- Dilepton (leptonic) charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\\\text{C}}^{\\\\ell\\\\bar{\\\\ell}} \\\\)\\n- Top-quark pair charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\\\text{C}}^{t\\\\bar{t}} \\\\)\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2208.12095"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2208.12095"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.031}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:AC_llbar", "hepkg:observable:AC_ttbar"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:081932d07db01039ea096af4", "hepkg:evidence:56c87e0aa5948364897f0452", "hepkg:evidence:8178ff592e72e79e9d251fab", "hepkg:evidence:82e9f886918fc8963ac3ebcd", "hepkg:evidence:b937da2d29e7a3aa27032e8d"], "seen_values": ["220