{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-04ab9b08", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2007.02873 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2007.02873 contains the following event regions across its channels:\n\n- **0-lepton channel:**\n  - High ΔR(b1,b2) control region (ttbar enriched)\n  - Low ΔR(b1,b2) control region (V+HF enriched)\n  - Signal region (SR)\n\n- **1-lepton channel:**\n  - High ΔR(b1,b2) control region (ttbar enriched)\n  - Low ΔR(b1,b2) control region (V+HF enriched)\n  - Multi-jet control region (MJ-CR)\n  - Signal region (SR)\n\n- **2-lepton channel:**\n  - eμ top control region (eμ-CR)\n  - High ΔR(b1,b2) control region\n  - Low ΔR(b1,b2) control region (Z+HF enriched)\n  - Signal region (SR)\n\nThese regions are used to define the control and signal regions for the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2007.02873"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2007.02873"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:0lep_cr_highdR", "hepkg:region:0lep_cr_lowdR", "hepkg:region:0lep_sr", "hepkg:region:1lep_cr_highdR", "hepkg:region:1lep_cr_lowdR", "hepkg:region:1lep_cr_mj", "hepkg:region:1lep_sr", "hepkg:region:2lep_cr_emu", "hepkg:region:2lep_cr_highdR", "hepkg:region:2lep_cr_lowdR", "hepkg:region:2lep_sr"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:12fc05dae2b9092f7b81ee6c", "hepkg:evidence:44435b75fc29880343040c72", "hepkg:evidence:88314c4481e1d113327e5ab3", "hepkg:evidence:925187ace709b2de25683cba", "hepkg:evidence:c653f6b2f25928b44715fcdd", "hepkg:evidence:dfe1bac6a782744ebdedf9f5", "hepkg:evidence:e94ecd43c80c919c11f3db7e"], "seen_values": ["-cr", "-lepton", "0", "1", "2", "2007.02873", "channel", "channel_has_region"