{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-0700b38d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2011.07812 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2011.07812 defines 18 object selection requirements. Here they are:\n\n- \\((pT_{\\text{track}} - pT_{e})/pT_{e} > -0.5\\)\n- \\(3 \\text{ mm} < |d0| < 300 \\text{ mm} \\, (\\text{signal electron})\\)\n- \\(3 \\text{ mm} < |d0| < 300 \\text{ mm} \\, (\\text{signal muon})\\)\n- Calorimeter isolation < 15% of muon energy\n- Calorimeter isolation < 6% of electron energy\n- Combined ID+MS fit \\(\\chi^2/\\text{nDOF} < 3\\), \\(\\geq3\\) precision MS layers, \\(\\geq1\\) high-precision \\(\\phi\\) measurement\n- ID track \\(\\chi^2/\\text{nDOF} < 2\\) and \\(\\leq1\\) missing hit after innermost hit\n- MS segment window: \\(|\\eta_{\\mu} + \\eta_{\\text{MSsegment}}| < 0.018\\) and \\(|(\\phi_{\\mu} - \\phi_{\\text{MSsegment}}) - \\pi| < 0.25\\)\n- Standard identification algorithm with \\(|d0|\\) and hit-count requirements removed\n- Track isolation < 4% of muon \\(pT\\)\n- Track isolation < 6% of electron \\(pT\\)\n- \\(pT > 65 \\text{ GeV} \\, (\\text{signal electron})\\)\n- \\(pT > 65 \\text{ GeV} \\, (\\text{signal muon})\\)\n- \\(|d0| < 10 \\text{ mm} \\, (\\text{standard tracking stage})\\)\n- \\(|d0| < 300 \\text{ mm} \\, (\\text{extended tracking stage})\\)\n- \\(|eta| < 2.5\\)\n- \\(|t0_{\\text{avg}}| < 30 \\text{ ns}\\)\n\nThese requirements are detailed in the paper with the arXiv ID 2011.07812.\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2011.07812"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 17, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:12d32981beb66e