{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-096dee37", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many observables does analysis 2201.11585 measure?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2201.11585 measures the following observables:\n\n1. Higgs boson invisible branching fraction \\( B(H \\to \\text{inv}) \\)\n2. Signal strength \\( \\mu = (\\sigma_H/\\sigma_H^{\\text{SM}}) \\times B(H \\to \\text{inv}) \\)\n3. Spin-independent dark-matter-nucleon elastic scattering cross section (Higgs-portal)\n\nTherefore, the analysis measures **3 observables**.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2201.11585 measures 3 observables: Higgs boson invisible branching fraction \\( B(H \\\\to \\\\text{inv}) \\), signal strength \\( \\\\mu = (\\\\sigma_H/\\\\sigma_H^{\\\\text{SM}}) \\\\times B(H \\\\to \\\\text{inv}) \\), and spin-independent dark-matter-nucleon elastic scattering cross section (Higgs-portal).\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2201.11585"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2201.11585"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.034}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:br_h_to_inv", "hepkg:observable:si_dm_nucleon_xs", "hepkg:observable:signal_strength_mu"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0cf746a96c3eb90a906fdd82", "hepkg:evidence:3c64558a78a4be9d2e3ca486", "hepkg:evidence:f18f126de5e1f4bd6f9fcac6"], "seen_values": ["2201.11585", "boson", "branching", "cross", "dark-matter-nucleon", "elastic", "fraction", "hepkg:observable:br_h_to_inv", "hepkg:observable:si_dm_nucleon_xs", "hepkg:observable:signal_strength_mu", "higgs", "higgs-portal", "inv", "invisible", "observable", "result_measures_observable", "scattering",