{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-0b7a384c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which detector objects does analysis 2004.04545 define?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2004.04545 defines the following detector objects:\n\n- $W$ boson candidate\n- Diphoton system (H→γγ candidate)\n- Jet\n- Lepton (electron or muon)\n- Photon\n- b-tagged jet\n- Primary top quark candidate ($t_{1}$)\n- Secondary top quark candidate ($t_{2}$)\n\nThese objects are used in the analysis as part of the event reconstruction and selection criteria.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2403.01556", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2004.04545"], "predicate": "result_defines_object"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:b_jet", "hepkg:object:diphoton_system", "hepkg:object:jet", "hepkg:object:lepton", "hepkg:object:photon", "hepkg:object:top_quark_candidate_t1", "hepkg:object:top_quark_candidate_t2", "hepkg:object:w_boson_candidate"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0b7e49bdf97fdec123939dca", "hepkg:evidence:1a90e81fe6e2599c6be5a3d2", "hepkg:evidence:218c0751daadc168fe290a22", "hepkg:evidence:672619fbe2924e28054465f2", "hepkg:evidence:876c88f577a502b91