{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-0cd6addb", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2006.05880 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2006.05880 measures the following observables:\n\n- 95% CL excluded mass limit on SUSY particle mass\n- Discovery \\( p \\)-value \\( p(s=0) \\)\n- Model-independent 95% CL upper limit on the number of BSM events (\\( S^{95}_{\\text{obs}} \\), \\( S^{95}_{\\text{exp}} \\))\n- Observed number of events in a signal region\n- Visible BSM cross-section upper limit (\\( \\sigma_{\\text{vis}} \\))\n\nThese measurements are supported by the following quotes from the paper:\n\n- \"95% CL excluded mass limit on SUSY particle mass\"\n- \"Discovery \\( p \\)-value \\( p(s=0) \\)\"\n- \"Model-independent 95% CL upper limit on number of BSM events (S^95_obs, S^95_exp)\"\n- \"Observed number of events in a signal region\"\n- \"Visible BSM cross-section upper limit (sigma_vis)\"\n\nAnswered from the graph.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2006.05880 measures the following observables:\\n\\n- 95% CL excluded mass limit on SUSY particle mass\\n- Discovery \\( p \\)-value \\( p(s=0) \\)\\n- Model-independent 95% CL upper limit on the number of BSM events (\\( S^{95}_{\\\\text{obs}} \\\\), \\( S^{95}_{\\\\text{exp}} \\))\\n- Observed number of events in a signal region\\n- Visible BSM cross-section upper limit (\\( \\\\sigma_{\\\\text{vis}} \\))\\n\\nThese measurements are supported by the following quotes from the paper:\\n\\n- \\\"95% CL excluded mass limit on SUSY particle mass\\\"\\n- \\\"Discovery \\( p \\)-value \\( p(s=0) \\\"\\n- \\\"Model-independent 95% CL upper limit on number of BSM events (S^95_obs, S^95_exp)\\\"\\n- \\\"Observed number of events in a signal region\\\"\\n- \\\"Visible BSM cross-secti