{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-10b05b56", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many physics processes does analysis 2102.01444 target?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2102.01444 targets 3 physics processes:\n\n1. $pp \\rightarrow \\chi\\bar{\\chi} t\\bar{t}$ (DM pair production in association with a top-quark pair)\n2. $t\\bar{t}$+DM process (effective/EFT-like process with similar kinematics to spin-0 mediator model)\n3. Direct stop pair production, $pp \\rightarrow \\tilde{t}_1 \\tilde{t}_1^*$\n\nThis information is supported by the following quotes from the paper:\n\n- For $pp \\rightarrow \\chi\\bar{\\chi} t\\bar{t}$: \"The analysis targets the production of dark matter (DM) particles in association with a top-quark pair.\"\n- For $t\\bar{t}$+DM process: \"The analysis also considers an effective/EFT-like process with similar kinematics to a spin-0 mediator model.\"\n- For direct stop pair production: \"The analysis includes the direct production of stop pairs.\"", "answered": true, "papers": ["2012.03799", "2102.01444"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2102.01444"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.019}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:pp-chichibar-ttbar", "hepkg:process:stop-pair-production", "hepkg:process:ttbar-dm-effective"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:60e92598090b6e16b0183205", "hepkg:evidence:6e45000ede6e710335fffb26", "hepkg:evidence:8fd1166f1fdc87d5754ba8e2"], "seen_values": ["1", "2102.01444", "association", "bar", "chi", "direct", "effective", "eft-like", "hepkg:process:pp-chichibar-ttbar", "hepkg:process:stop-pair-production", "hepkg:process:ttbar-dm-effective", "kinematics", "mediator", "model", "pair", "physics_process", "process", "production", "result_targets