{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-110f5056", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many event regions do the channels of analysis 2102.01444 contain?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2102.01444 contains 20 event regions across its channels. These include various control regions (CR), signal regions (SR), and validation regions (VR) for different decay modes and lepton flavors.\n\nHere is the list of event regions:\n\n- CR$^{2-body}_{t\\bar t}$: two-body $t\\bar t$ control region\n- CR$^{3-body}_{VV}$: three-body diboson control region\n- CR$^{3-body}_{t\\bar t}$: three-body $t\\bar t$ control region\n- CR$^{4-body}_{VV}$: four-body diboson control region\n- CR$^{4-body}_{t\\bar t}$: four-body $t\\bar t$ control region\n- CR$^{FNP}$: fake/non-prompt lepton control region used to derive fake factors for all selections\n- CR$_{t\\bar t Z}$: $t\\bar t Z$ control region (shared by two-body and three-body selections)\n- SR$^{2-body}_{[x,\\infty)}$: two-body inclusive signal region (DF+SF combined, model-independent limits)\n- SR$^{4-body}_{Large\\,\\Delta m}$: four-body signal region for larger $\\Delta m(\\tilde t_1,\\tilde\\chi_1^0)$\n- SR$^{4-body}_{Small\\,\\Delta m}$: four-body signal region for small $\\Delta m(\\tilde t_1,\\tilde\\chi_1^0)$\n- SR-DF$^{2-body}_{[x,y)}$: two-body binned signal regions, different-flavour leptons, binned in $m_{T2}^{\\ell\\ell}$\n- SR-DF$^{3-body}_{W}$: three-body signal region targeting $\\Delta m(\\tilde t,\\tilde\\chi_1^0)\\sim m(W)$, different-flavour leptons\n- SR-DF$^{3-body}_{t}$: three-body signal region targeting $\\Delta m(\\tilde t,\\tilde\\chi_1^0)\\sim m(t)$, different-flavour leptons\n- SR-SF$^{2-body}_{[x,y)}$: two-body binned signal regions, same-flavour leptons, binned in $m_{T2}^{\\ell\\ell}$\n- SR-SF$^{3-body}_{W}$: three-body signal region targeting $\\Delta m(\\tilde t,\\tilde\\chi_1^0)\\sim m(W)$, same-flavour leptons\n- SR-SF$^{3-body}_{t}$: three-body signal region targeting $\\Delta m(\\tilde t,\\tilde\\chi_1^0)\\sim m(t)$, same-flavour leptons\n- VR$^{2-body}_{t\\bar t Z}$: two-body $t\\bar t Z$ validation region (four-lepton)\n- VR$^{2-body}_{t\\bar t,DF}$: two-body $t\\bar t$ validation region, different-flavour leptons\n- VR$^{2-body}_{t\\bar t,SF}$: two-body $t\\bar t$ validation region, same-flavour leptons\n- VR$^{3-body}_{VV}$: three-body diboson validation region\n- VR$^{4-body}_{VV,3\\ell}$: four-body diboson validation region (three-lepton)\n- VR$^{4-body}_{VV}$: four-body diboson validation region (two-lepton)\n- VR$^{4-body}_{t\\bar t}$: four-body $t\\bar t$ validation region\n- VR(1)$^{3-body}_{t\\bar t}$: three-body $t", "answered": true, "papers": ["2102.01444"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2102.01444"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 25, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:cr-2body-ttbar", "hepkg:region:cr-3body-ttbar", "hepkg:region:cr-3body-vv", "hepkg:region:cr-4body-ttbar", "hepkg:region:cr-4body-vv", "hepkg:region:cr-fnp", "hepkg:region:cr-ttbarZ", "hepkg:region:sr-2body-inclusive", "hepkg:region:sr-4body-largedm", "hepkg:region:sr-4body-smalldm", "hepkg:region:sr-df-2body", "hepkg:region:sr-df-3body-t", "hepkg:region:sr-df-3body-w", "hepkg:region:sr-sf-2body", "hepkg:region:sr-sf-3body-t", "hepkg:region:sr-sf-3body-w", "hepkg:region:vr-2body-ttbar-df", "hepkg:region:vr-2body-ttbar-sf", "hepkg:region:vr-2body-ttbarZ", "hepkg:region:vr-3body-vv", "hepkg:region:vr-4body-ttbar", "hepkg:region:vr-4body-vv", "hepkg:region:vr-4body-vv-3l", "hepkg:region:vr1-3body-ttbar", "hepkg:region:vr2-3body-ttbar"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:16f11bfe0deafa4d579d2f76", "hepkg:evidence:1f66d86402874c5f9d15431d", "hepkg:evidence:2ddd55d23b55f5487fc01492", "hepkg:evidence:39f8d8494cb3047