{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-11d27756", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many event regions do the channels of analysis 2106.01676 contain?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2106.01676 contains 18 event regions across its channels:\n\n- Off-shell WZ selection signal regions (SR^offWZ)\n- On-shell WZ selection signal regions (SR^WZ)\n- RJR ISR signal region (SR3l-ISR)\n- RJR diboson control region, low-mass and ISR (CR3l-VV / CR3l-ISR-VV)\n- RJR diboson validation region, low-mass and ISR (VR3l-VV / VR3l-ISR-VV)\n- RJR low-mass signal region (SR3l-Low)\n- WZ control region for off-shell WZ selection (CR^WZ_offWZ)\n- WZ control region for on-shell WZ/Wh selections (CR^WZ_WZ)\n- WZ validation region for off-shell WZ selection (VR^WZ_offWZ)\n- Wh selection signal regions, DFOS subset (SR^Wh_DFOS)\n- Wh selection signal regions, SFOS subset (SR^Wh_SFOS)\n- Z+jets fake-factor measurement region for off-shell WZ selection (CR^FF_offWZ)\n- Z+jets fake-factor measurement region for on-shell WZ/Wh selections (CR^FF_WZ)\n- Z+jets fake-factor validation region for on-shell WZ/Wh selections (VR^FF_WZ)\n- Z+jets fake-factor validation regions for off-shell WZ selection (VR^FF_offWZ)\n- ttbar anti-ID normalisation control region for off-shell WZ selection (CR^ttbar_offWZ,anti-ID)\n- ttbar validation region for off-shell WZ selection (VR^ttbar_offWZ)\n- ttbar validation region for on-shell WZ/Wh selections (VR^ttbar_WZ)\n\nThis information is based on the content of the paper 2106.01676.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2106.01676 contains 18 event regions across its channels. These regions include: Off-shell WZ selection signal regions (SR^offWZ), On-shell WZ selection signal regions (SR^WZ), RJR ISR signal region (SR3l-ISR), RJR diboson control region, l