{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-1524adc5", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many simulated samples does analysis 2604.21670 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2604.21670 uses 17 simulated samples:\n\n- Charged-current Drell-Yan W production sample (Powheg Box, NLO, CT10 PDF)\n- Dedicated SMEFT SM/linear/quadratic signal samples (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO + SMEFTsim 3.0, LO)\n- Di-Higgs ggF production sample (Powheg Box, NLO, finite top-mass effects)\n- Electroweak Zjj production sample (Herwig 7.1.5 + VBFNLO, NLO QCD)\n- Gluon-initiated WW production sample (Sherpa, LO)\n- Higgs boson propagator correction sample (SMEFTsim 3.0, dummy fields)\n- Neutral-current Drell-Yan tau-tau production sample (Sherpa, NLO+LO merged)\n- Nominal ttbar boosted sample (Powheg Box, NLO, NNPDF3.0)\n- Nominal ttbar dilepton sample (Powheg Box, NLO, NNPDF3.0)\n- SM and SMEFT electroweak precision observable predictions (ewpd4lhc)\n- SMEFT NLO QCD predictions for loop-induced Higgs processes and ttbar analyses (SMEFTatNLO)\n- VBF and VH Higgs boson production sample (Powheg Box, NLO QCD)\n- VH and ttH production sample for the VBF H→bb analysis (Powheg Box, NNPDF3.0)\n- WW and WZ production sample (Sherpa, NLO+LO merged)\n- ggF Higgs boson production sample (Powheg Box NNLOPS)\n- ggF and VBF production sample for the VBF H→bb analysis (Powheg Box, NNPDF3.0)\n- ttH Higgs boson production sample (Powheg Box or MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, NLO QCD)\n\nThis list is based on the information recorded in the graph for this analysis.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2604.21670 uses 17 simulated samples, including charged-current Drell-Yan W production, dedicated SMEFT signal samples, di-Higgs ggF production, electroweak Zjj production, gluon-initiated WW production, and others. The full list is provided above.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}", "answered": true, "papers": ["2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2604.21670"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 17, "error": null, "seconds": 0.055}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:ew_zjj_herwig_sample", "hepkg:sample:ewpo_smeft_prediction", "hepkg:sample:gg_ww_sherpa_sample", "hepkg:sample:ggf_higgs_powheg_nnlops", "hepkg:sample:hh_ggf_powheg_sample", "hepkg:sample:higgs_propagator_correction_sample", "hepkg:sample:hmdy_cc_powheg_sample", "hepkg:sample:hmdy_nc_tautau_sherpa_sample", "hepkg:sample:smeft_lo_signal_sample", "hepkg:sample:smeft_nlo_loop_ttbar_sample", "hepkg:sample:ttbar_boosted_powheg_sample", "hepkg:sample:ttbar_dilepton_powheg_sample", "hepkg:sample:tth_higgs_sample", "hepkg:sample:vbf_hbb_ggf_vbf_sample", "hepkg:sample:vbf_hbb_vh_tth_sample", "hepkg:sample:vbf_vh_higgs_powheg", "hepkg:sample:ww_wz_sherpa_sample"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:081de95844684fcc7ae76202", "hepkg:evidence:1100b9451384f7e9b8d5d276", "hepkg:evidence:1a38f592be0c5916eb8aa637", "hepkg:evidence:22b640ce8d170f67bf9fece6", "hepkg:evidence:3bf4aabf5d519056406fc52c", "hepkg:evidence:3c60c202ab67997151737108", "hepkg:evidence:414c3ce567889a34e66f45fb", "hepkg:evidence:46de0530799e77e60fd3919b", "hepkg:evidence:4c63b40857022d828a7d8277", "hepkg:evidence:73d20428c026879823f59103", "hepkg:evidence:74d0510522c35279f6d7d565", "hepkg:evidence:971ffa3937e303dd9aaa654b", "hepkg:evidence:97a841422e7dd9a53fe0f49b", "hepkg:evidence:d5cf618b9de005ba1c519ff3", "hepkg:evidence:d67cc52ddbedf05720b18af3", "hepkg:evidence:e36c89a475a82f445e585be3", "hepkg:evidence:f18762c296211a995df67796"], "seen_values": ["0", "2604.2167", "2604.21670", "3", "3.0", "7.1.5", "analyses", "analysis", "and", "boosted", "boson", "box", "charged-current", "correction", "ct10", "dedicated", "di-higgs", "dilepton", "drell-yan", "dummy", "effects", "electroweak",