{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-1b4e2901", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2102.01444 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2102.01444 measures the following observables:\n\n- 95% CL exclusion contour in the $\\tilde t_1$–$\\tilde\\chi_1^0$ mass plane\n- 95% CL upper limit on observed signal cross-section relative to theoretical prediction ($\\sigma_{\\mathrm{obs}}/\\sigma_{\\mathrm{Th}}(g=1.0)$)\n- 95% CL upper limit on the visible number of signal events ($S_{\\mathrm{obs}}^{95}$, $S_{\\mathrm{exp}}^{95}$)\n- 95% CL upper limit on visible cross-section of BSM physics (⟨εσ⟩_obs^95)\n- Discovery $p$-value $p(s=0)$\n\nThese measurements are supported by the following evidence from the paper:\n\n- '95% CL exclusion contour in the $\\tilde t_1$–$\\tilde\\chi_1^0$ mass plane'\n- '95% CL upper limit on observed signal cross-section relative to theoretical prediction ($\\sigma_{\\mathrm{obs}}/\\sigma_{\\mathrm{Th}}(g=1.0)$)'\n- '95% CL upper limit on the visible number of signal events ($S_{\\mathrm{obs}}^{95}$, $S_{\\mathrm{exp}}^{95}$)'\n- '95% CL upper limit on visible cross-section of BSM physics (⟨εσ⟩_obs^95)'\n- 'Discovery $p$-value $p(s=0)$'", "answered": true, "papers": ["2006.05880", "2010.14293", "2102.01444"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2102.01444"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.034}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:discovery-pvalue", "hepkg:observable:exclusion-limit-mass-plane", "hepkg:observable:signal-cross-section-ratio-ul", "hepkg:observable:signal-events-ul", "hepkg:observable:visible-cross-section-ul"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:071a0012f7b999dffe712de7", "hepkg:evidence:39b00a50d06c60388616df36", "hepkg:evidence:3a8