{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-1d83dddc", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many event regions do the channels of analysis 2012.08600 contain?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2012.08600 contains 14 event regions in its channels:\n\n- Boosted VZ (EW on-Z)\n- Edge b tag counting region\n- Edge b veto counting region\n- Edge fit region\n- HZ (EW on-Z)\n- Resolved VZ (EW on-Z)\n- SRA b tag (strong on-Z)\n- SRA b veto (strong on-Z)\n- SRB b tag (strong on-Z)\n- SRB b veto (strong on-Z)\n- SRC b tag (strong on-Z)\n- SRC b veto (strong on-Z)\n- Slepton jet-less region\n- Slepton with jets region\n\nThis information is directly extracted from the paper 2012.08600.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2012.08600 contains 14 event regions in its channels. These regions are: Boosted VZ (EW on-Z), Edge b tag counting region, Edge b veto counting region, Edge fit region, HZ (EW on-Z), Resolved VZ (EW on-Z), SRA b tag (strong on-Z), SRA b veto (strong on-Z), SRB b tag (strong on-Z), SRB b veto (strong on-Z), SRC b tag (strong on-Z), SRC b veto (strong on-Z), Slepton jet-less region, and Slepton with jets region.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}", "answered": true, "papers": ["2012.08600"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2012.08600"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:boosted_vz", "hepkg:region:edge_btag_counting", "hepkg:region:edge_bveto_counting", "hepkg:region:edge_fit", "hepkg:region:hz", "hepkg:region:resolved_vz", "hepkg:region:slepton_jetless", "hepkg:region:slepton_with_jets", "hepkg:region:sra_btag", "hepkg:region:sra_bveto", "hepkg:region:srb_btag", "hepkg:region:srb_bveto", "hepkg:region:s