{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-1d8e8354", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many physics processes does analysis 2506.13565 target?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2506.13565 targets 2 physics processes: 1. b → s ℓ+ℓ− flavor-changing neutral current transition (ID: hepkg:process:b-to-s-ll-fcnc) 2. qq̄ → ℓ+ℓ− via bbℓℓ four-fermion contact interaction (ID: hepkg:process:qq-to-ll-ci). These processes are supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper: - For the first process: 'The analysis targets the b → s ℓ+ℓ− flavor-changing neutral current transition.' - For the second process: 'The analysis also targets the qq̄ → ℓ+ℓ− via bbℓℓ four-fermion contact interaction.'", "answered": true, "papers": ["2506.13565"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2506.13565"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.017}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:b-to-s-ll-fcnc", "hepkg:process:qq-to-ll-ci"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:642bba0349759b812338a766", "hepkg:evidence:6ee29db472c10f926dfcd0d7"], "seen_values": ["2506.13565", "contact", "current", "flavor-changing", "four-fermion", "hepkg:process:b-to-s-ll-fcnc", "hepkg:process:qq-to-ll-ci", "interaction", "neutral", "physics_process", "result_targets_process", "transition", "via"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 8858, "completion_tokens": 418, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 16.215480380225927, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 16.215480380225927, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9276.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_er