{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-1e58506c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2504.13081 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2504.13081 measures the following observables:\n\n- Absolute pseudorapidity difference between the two leading jets (|Δη_jj|)\n- Absolute value of the Higgs boson rapidity (|y_H|)\n- Higgs boson transverse momentum (p_T^H)\n- Invariant mass of the dijet system of the two leading-p_T jets (m_jj)\n- Jet multiplicity (N_jets)\n- Jet p_T weighted by a function of its rapidity (tau^j_C)\n- Total Higgs boson production cross section (sigma_tot)\n- Transverse momentum of the leading hadronic jet (p_T^{j1})\n\nThese observables are recorded in the paper with the arXiv ID 2504.13081.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2207.12246", "2309.14442", "2504.13081"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2504.13081"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:abs_deta_jj", "hepkg:observable:abs_y_h", "hepkg:observable:m_jj", "hepkg:observable:n_jets", "hepkg:observable:pt_h", "hepkg:observable:pt_j1", "hepkg:observable:sigma_tot", "hepkg:observable:tau_c_j"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:35045352c9853d34862581c2", "hepkg:evidence:38dfc3024a0aa7e1380458f5", "hepkg:evidence:4f11d65eeeb98ee95fe84b25", "hepkg:evidence:662a7dc2d53de9cca2058ae4", "hepkg:evidence:66f20aa05cbc2a125ecbdbdf", "hepkg:evidence:839476f3c1dee0c73b6ead4d", "hepkg:evidence:970659fd7358d281dda8f4a4", "hepkg:evidence:be8d9780dc1fc1756b69485c", "hepkg:evidence:c486c4c83c88007c514d3331", "hepkg:evidence:d1417184182bf5fdbf0aa64e", "hepkg:evidence:de67de9565ce40c34e244164", "hepkg:evidence:f7eb322e35c3ce78d50f449f", "hepkg:evidence:fe364b6353fa2b7e7db7d