{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-21a202a1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2112.00895 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2112.00895 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- **SL channel selection, W→e ν decay (reconstructed)**\n- **SL channel selection, W→μ ν decay (reconstructed)**\n- **SV channel selection, W→e ν decay (reconstructed)**\n- **SV channel selection, W→μ ν decay (reconstructed)**\n\nThese regions correspond to the selection criteria for the single-lepton (SL) and single-vector (SV) channels, with the W boson decaying into either an electron-neutrino pair or a muon-neutrino pair.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2112.00895"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2112.00895"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.034}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:sl_electron", "hepkg:region:sl_muon", "hepkg:region:sv_electron", "hepkg:region:sv_muon"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:c6d12da933555cdcb9e29833"], "seen_values": ["2112.00895", "channel", "channel_has_region", "decay", "event_region", "hepkg:region:sl_electron", "hepkg:region:sl_muon", "hepkg:region:sv_electron", "hepkg:region:sv_muon", "reconstructed", "selection"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 8919, "completion_tokens": 172, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 6.713450592011213, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 6.713450592011213, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9091.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "retrieved_label_recall": 1.0, "retrieved_entities": 4.0, "mentioned_label_recall": 0.0,