{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-22d38e1b", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many region selection requirements does analysis 2205.05120 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "It seems that the graph does not record the specific selection requirements for the regions defined in analysis 2205.05120. However, we can list the regions defined by this analysis:\n\n- 0-jet category (targets ggH production)\n- Baseline H->tautau candidate event selection (pre-categorization)\n- Boosted category (remaining 1-jet / non-VBF multi-jet events)\n- Multijet QCD control region for tau_h channels (same-sign di-tau pair)\n- VBF category (targets VBF and ggH+2jets production)\n- VBF high-m_jj boosted category (Delta phi_jj cross-check method)\n- VBF high-m_jj category (Delta phi_jj cross-check method)\n- VBF low-m_jj boosted category (Delta phi_jj cross-check method)\n- VBF low-m_jj category (Delta phi_jj cross-check method)\n- W+jets control region (m_T > 70 GeV)\n- e-mu channel QCD multijet sideband region (same-sign leptons)\n- jet->tau_h misidentification sideband region (relaxed tau_h ID)\n\nSince the graph does not record the selection requirements for these regions, I cannot provide the exact number of selection requirements. \n\n**Answer:** The graph does not record the specific selection requirements for the regions defined in analysis 2205.05120. However, the analysis defines 12 distinct regions. \n\n**Reason:** Not in graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2205.05120"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2205.05120"], "predicate": "result_defines_region"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.045}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "region_has_selection", "object_ids": ["hepkg:region:ggh-0jet-category", "hepkg:region:ditau-baseline-selec