{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-264612ce", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many simulated samples does analysis 2401.07090 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2401.07090 uses 17 simulated samples:\n\n- Inclusive b hadron simulated sample(s)\n- Inclusive soft QCD Pythia sample with b hadron production filter\n- Simulated \\( B^+ \\rightarrow \\overline{D}^0(\\rightarrow K^+\\pi^-)\\pi^+ \\) sample without charm veto\n- Simulated \\( B^+ \\rightarrow J/\\psi K^*(892)^+ \\) sample\n- Simulated \\( B^+ \\rightarrow J/\\psi K^+ \\) resonant sample\n- Simulated \\( B^+ \\rightarrow K^*(892)^+ l^+l^- \\) sample\n- Simulated \\( B^+ \\rightarrow K^+ l^+l^- \\) signal sample (nonresonant)\n- Simulated \\( B^+ \\rightarrow \\psi(2S) K^*(892)^+ \\) sample\n- Simulated \\( B^+ \\rightarrow \\psi(2S) K^+ \\) resonant sample\n- Simulated \\( B^0 \\rightarrow J/\\psi K^*(892)^0 \\) sample\n- Simulated \\( B^0 \\rightarrow K^*(892)^0 l^+l^- \\) sample\n- Simulated \\( B^0 \\rightarrow \\psi(2S) K^*(892)^0 \\) sample\n- Simulated Cabibbo-suppressed \\( B^+ \\rightarrow J/\\psi \\pi^+ \\) sample\n- Simulated Cabibbo-suppressed \\( B^+ \\rightarrow \\pi^+ l^+l^- \\) sample\n- Simulated Cabibbo-suppressed \\( B^+ \\rightarrow \\psi(2S) \\pi^+ \\) sample\n- Simulated charmless \\( B^+ \\rightarrow K^+\\pi^-\\pi^+ \\) sample\n- Simulated minimum bias pileup sample\n\nThis information is supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n- \"Inclusive b hadron simulated sample(s)\"\n- \"Inclusive soft QCD pythia sample with b hadron production filter\"\n- \"Simulated B+ -> Dbar0(->K+pi-)pi+ sample without charm veto\"\n- \"Simulated B+ -> J/psi K*(892)^+ sample\"\n- \"Simulated B+ -> J/psi K+ resonant sample\"\n- \"Simulated B+ -> K*(892)^+ l+l- sample\"\n- \"Simulated B+ -> K+ l+l- signal sample (nonresonant)\"\n- \"Simulated B+ -> psi(2S) K*(892)^+ sample\"\n- \"Simulated B+ -> psi(2S) K+ resonant sample\"\n- \"Simulated B0 -> J/psi K*(892)^0 sample\"\n- \"Simulated B0 -> K*(892)^0 l+l- sample\"\n- \"Simulated B0 -> psi(2S) K*(892)^0 sample\"\n- \"Simulated Cabibbo-suppressed B+ -> J/psi pi+ sample\"\n- \"Simulated Cabibbo-suppressed B+ -> pi+ l+l- sample\"\n- \"Simulated Cabibbo-suppressed B+ -> psi(2S) pi+ sample\"\n- \"Simulated charmless B+ -> K+pi-pi+ sample\"\n- \"Simulated minimum bias pileup sample\"\n\nTherefore, the analysis 2401.07090 uses 17 simulated samples.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2401.07090 uses 17 simulated samples,", "answered": true, "papers": ["2401.07090"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2401.07090"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 17, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:mc_b0_jpsi_kstar0", "hepkg:sample:mc_b0_kstar0_ll", "hepkg:sample:mc_b0_psi2s_kstar0", "hepkg:sample:mc_bp_d0bar_pi_nocharmveto", "hepkg:sample:mc_bp_jpsi_kstarp", "hepkg:sample:mc_bp_jpsi_pi", "hepkg:sample:mc_bp_jpsik", "hepkg:sample:mc_bp_k_ll", "hepkg:sample:mc_bp_kpipi_charmless", "hepkg:sample:mc_bp_kstarp_ll", "hepkg:sample:mc_bp_pi_ll", "hepkg:sample:mc_bp_psi2s_kstarp", "hepkg:sample:mc_bp_psi2s_pi", "hepkg:sample:mc_bp_psi2sk", "hepkg:sample:mc_inclusive_b_hadron", "hepkg:sample:mc_minbias_pileup", "hepkg:sample:mc_softqcd_bfilter"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:04e93ae38640770500942aec", "hepkg:evidence:21784e872103c71af254f753", "hepkg:evidence:2caca7af19ce7a572dbe9d82", "hepkg:evidence:872fc226c03db53c67c43997", "hepkg:evidence:939e0e11a354fc67f432c50f", "hepkg:evidence:d8ddb9501dff6df68a3e0713"], "seen_values": ["0", "2", "2401.0709", "2401.07090", "892", "bias", "cabibbo-suppressed", "charm", "charmless", "dbar0", "filter", "hadron", "hepkg:sample:mc_b0_jpsi_kstar0", "hepkg:sample:mc_b0_kstar0_ll", 