{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-276670f3", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which physics processes does analysis 2004.01678 target?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2004.01678 targets the following physics processes:\n\n- H → Z J/ψ\n- H → Z η_c\n- H → Za (a → hadrons)\n\nThese processes are recorded in the graph as the targets of the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2004.01678"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.019}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:h-to-z-a", "hepkg:process:h-to-z-etac", "hepkg:process:h-to-z-jpsi"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:001362522490aa3057b9850f", "hepkg:evidence:015d77d6f7a140683784bc0a", "hepkg:evidence:48f508375f2272eb62513958", "hepkg:evidence:f2e6b0c956a52acbe2ea376f"], "seen_values": ["2004.01678", "hadrons", "hepkg:process:h-to-z-a", "hepkg:process:h-to-z-etac", "hepkg:process:h-to-z-jpsi", "physics_process", "result_targets_process"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 8836, "completion_tokens": 98, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 3.7694827900268137, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 3.7694827900268137, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 8934.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "retrieved_label_recall": 1.0, "retrieved_entities": 3.0, "mentioned_label_recall": 1.0, "truncation_loss_labels": 0.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 3.0, "evidence_quotes": 4.0}}
{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-276f368c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many simulated samples does analysis 2508.13900 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2508.13900 uses 14 simulated samples:\n\n- $Z/\\gamma^{*}$ (Z+jets) simulated sample\n- Diboson (VV) background sample (WW, ZZ, WZ, WH, ZH incl. Higgs to diboson)\n- QCD multijet background sample\n- Single top quark (ST) background sample (s-channel, t-channel, tW-associated)\n- T2bW (top squark pair production, decay via intermediate chargino to W boson)\n- T2cc (top squark pair production, decay via charm quark)\n- T2tt (top squark pair production, decay via top quark)\n- TChiSlepSnu (chargino pair production via intermediate slepton/sneutrino)\n- TChiWW (chargino pair production, decay via W bosons)\n- TChiWZ (associated chargino-neutralino production, decay via W/Z bosons)\n- TSlepSlep (direct slepton pair production)\n- Triboson (VVV) background sample\n- W+jets background MC sample\n- ttbar+X+jets background sample (ttbar+jets, dilepton/single-lepton, and ttbar+boson)\n\nThis list includes both Standard Model background samples and Beyond-the-Standard-Model (BSM) signal samples.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2508.13900 uses 14 simulated samples, including both Standard Model background samples and Beyond-the-Standard-Model (BSM) signal samples.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2106.01676", "2112.03161", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2402.08486", "2503.19420", "2508.13900"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2508.13900"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:model:t2bw", "hepkg:model:t2cc", "