{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-29b64b43", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2602.18611 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2602.18611 measures the following observables:\n\n- Effective Higgs boson coupling modifier (kappa_g, kappa_gamma, kappa_Zgamma) and total width\n- Higgs boson branching fraction to invisible final states (B_inv)\n- Higgs boson branching fraction to undetected final states (B_undet)\n- Higgs boson decay branching fraction ratio relative to H->ZZ (R^f/ZZ)\n- Higgs boson signal strength modifier per decay channel (mu^f)\n- Higgs boson signal strength modifier per production process (mu^i)\n- Higgs boson signal strength modifier per production process and decay channel (mu^if)\n- Higgs boson trilinear self-coupling modifier (kappa_lambda)\n- Inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier (mu_incl)\n- Lepton/quark coupling modifier ratio and related parameters (kappa_qq, lambda_lq, lambda_Vq)\n- Linear combination (eigenvector) of SMEFT Wilson coefficients from PCA\n- Ratio of Higgs boson coupling modifiers (lambda_ij)\n- Resolved Higgs boson coupling modifier (kappa_j)\n- SMEFT dimension-6 operator Wilson coefficient (c_j/Lambda^2)\n- STXS stage 0 production cross section times H->ZZ branching fraction (sigma^i x B^ZZ)\n- STXS stage 1.2 differential production cross section times H->ZZ branching fraction (sigma^i x B^ZZ)\n- Signal strength per STXS bin and decay channel (mu^if, 97 POIs)\n- Up-type/down-type fermion coupling modifier ratio and related parameters (kappa_uu, lambda_du, lambda_Vu)\n\nThese observables cover a wide range of Higgs boson properties and interactions, including couplings, branching fractions, and signal strengths.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2602.18611 measures the 