{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-2aad37bb", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many backgrounds does analysis 2207.00348 estimate?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2207.00348 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n1. Continuum γγ+γj+jj background (gg→H, qq'→Hqq' categories)\n2. Vγγ + prompt γγ background (V(→leptons)H categories)\n3. ttγγ and other top-associated background (ttH, tH categories)\n\nTherefore, the analysis estimates **3** backgrounds.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2207.00348"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2207.00348"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.027}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:continuum-gg-h-qqhqq", "hepkg:background:continuum-tth-th", "hepkg:background:continuum-vh"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:6135f248095d0b83bee3ae3d", "hepkg:evidence:a2460336042ab8c2a708ea39"], "seen_values": ["2207.00348", "and", "background", "categories", "continuum", "hepkg:background:continuum-gg-h-qqhqq", "hepkg:background:continuum-tth-th", "hepkg:background:continuum-vh", "hqq", "leptons", "other", "prompt", "result_estimates_background", "top-associated", "tth"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 8880, "completion_tokens": 131, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 5.49501342093572, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 5.49501342093572, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9011.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 3.0, "evidence_quotes": 2.0}}
{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-2ac7bb22", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which systematic uncertainties does analysis 2506.13565 report?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2506.13565 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\n\n- Additional 10% uncertainty on DY+jets scale factor in 1b/2b final states\n- Electron energy scale uncertainty\n- Integrated luminosity uncertainty\n- Jet energy resolution (JER) uncertainty\n- Jet energy scale (JES) uncertainty\n- L1 trigger prefiring rate uncertainty\n- Muon momentum scale uncertainty\n- Nonprompt/jets background normalization uncertainty\n- Overall lepton selection efficiency uncertainty (trigger, reconstruction, ID, isolation)\n- PDF and factorization/renormalization scale uncertainty\n- Pileup modeling uncertainty\n- Statistical uncertainty on DY+jets and ttbar CR-derived scale factors\n- b tagging efficiency scale factor uncertainty\n- ttbar estimation systematic from VR/SR shape comparison\n\nThese uncertainties are documented in the analysis.\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2309.14442", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2510.07527", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2506.13565"], "predicate": "result_has_systematic"}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "seconds": 0.049}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:systematic:btagging-sf", "hepkg:systematic:dy-sf-additional-10pct", "hepkg:systematic:electron-energy-scale", "h