{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-33177560", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many region selection requirements does analysis 2012.03799 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2012.03799 defines 19 region selection requirements. Here are some examples:\n\n- \\( C_{T2} > 400 \\) GeV\n- \\( \\Delta \\phi(\\text{MET}, \\text{lepton}) > 1.1 \\) rad\n- \\( \\Delta \\phi(\\text{MET}, \\text{lepton}) > 1.5 \\) rad\n- \\( \\Delta \\phi(\\text{jet1,2, MET}) > 0.4 \\) rad\n- \\( E_T^{\\text{miss}} > 230 \\) GeV\n- \\( E_T^{\\text{miss}} > 250 \\) GeV\n- \\( E_T^{\\text{miss}} > 400 \\) GeV\n- \\( E_T^{\\text{miss}} > 520 \\) GeV\n- \\( \\text{NN}_{\\text{bWN}} \\text{ score} > 0.9 \\)\n- \\( \\text{Topness} > 8 \\)\n- \\( \\text{Topness} > 9 \\)\n- \\( m_T > 110 \\) GeV\n- \\( m_T > 150 \\) GeV\n- \\( m_T > 180 \\) GeV\n- \\( m_T > 220 \\) GeV\n- \\( m_T > 380 \\) GeV\n- \\( m_{T2} < 360 \\) GeV\n- \\( m_{\\text{top}}^{\\text{reclustered}} > 150 \\) GeV\n\nThese requirements are used to define the various signal and preselection regions in the analysis.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2012.03799 defines 19 region selection requirements. Examples include \\( C_{T2} > 400 \\) GeV, \\( \\\\Delta \\\\phi(\\\\text{MET}, \\\\text{lepton}) > 1.1 \\\\) rad, \\( E_T^{\\\\text{miss}} > 230 \\\\) GeV, and \\( m_T > 110 \\\\) GeV.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2012.03799"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2012.03799"], "predicate": "result_defines_region"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.045}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "region_has_selection", "object_ids": ["hepkg:region:SR-DM_pseudoscalar", "hepkg:region:SR-DM_scala