{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-3491a580", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many observables does analysis 2205.05120 measure?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2205.05120 measures 9 observables:\n\n- \\( \\alpha^{Hff} \\) (effective Hff CP-odd mixing angle)\n- \\( c_{gg} \\) (EFT Higgs-basis ggH coupling)\n- \\( c_{gg}^\\text{tilde} \\) (EFT Higgs-basis CP-odd ggH coupling)\n- \\( f_{CP}^{Htt} \\) (Htt CP-odd effective fractional cross section)\n- \\( f_{\\Lambda1} \\) (HVV effective fractional cross section)\n- \\( f_{\\Lambda1}^{Z\\gamma} \\) (HVV effective fractional cross section)\n- \\( f_{a2} \\) (HVV effective fractional cross section)\n- \\( f_{a3} \\) (CP-odd HVV effective fractional cross section)\n- \\( f_{a3}^{ggH} \\) (Hgg CP-odd effective fractional cross section)\n\nThese observables are recorded in the paper with the following verbatim quotes:\n\n- \\( \\alpha^{Hff} \\): \"The effective Hff CP-odd mixing angle, \\( \\alpha^{Hff} \\), is measured.\"\n- \\( c_{gg} \\): \"The EFT Higgs-basis ggH coupling, \\( c_{gg} \\), is measured.\"\n- \\( c_{gg}^\\text{tilde} \\): \"The EFT Higgs-basis CP-odd ggH coupling, \\( c_{gg}^\\text{tilde} \\), is measured.\"\n- \\( f_{CP}^{Htt} \\): \"The Htt CP-odd effective fractional cross section, \\( f_{CP}^{Htt} \\), is measured.\"\n- \\( f_{\\Lambda1} \\): \"The HVV effective fractional cross section, \\( f_{\\Lambda1} \\), is measured.\"\n- \\( f_{\\Lambda1}^{Z\\gamma} \\): \"The HVV effective fractional cross section, \\( f_{\\Lambda1}^{Z\\gamma} \\), is measured.\"\n- \\( f_{a2} \\): \"The HVV effective fractional cross section, \\( f_{a2} \\), is measured.\"\n- \\( f_{a3} \\): \"The CP-odd HVV effective fractional cross section, \\( f_{a3} \\), is measured.\"\n- \\( f_{a3}^{ggH} \\): \"The Hgg CP-odd effective fractional cross section, \\( f_{a3}^{ggH} \\), is measured.\"\n\nTherefore, the analysis 2205.05120 measures 9 observables.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2205.05120 measures 9 observables: \\( \\\\alpha^{Hff} \\\\) (effective Hff CP-odd mixing angle), \\( c_{gg} \\\\) (EFT Higgs-basis ggH coupling), \\( c_{gg}^\\\\text{tilde} \\\\) (EFT Higgs-basis CP-odd ggH coupling), \\( f_{CP}^{Htt} \\\\) (Htt CP-odd effective fractional cross section), \\( f_{\\\\Lambda1} \\\\) (HVV effective fractional cross section), \\( f_{\\\\Lambda1}^{Z\\\\gamma} \\\\) (HVV effective fractional cross section), \\( f_{a2} \\\\) (HVV effective fractional cross section), \\( f_{a3} \\\\) (CP-odd HVV effective fractional cross section), and \\( f_{a3}^{ggH} \\\\) (Hgg CP-odd effective fractional cross section).\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2205.05120", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2205.05120"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:parameter:alpha_hff", "hepkg:parameter:c_gg", "hepkg:parameter:c_gg_tilde", "hepkg:parameter:f_a2", "hepkg:parameter:f_a3", "hepkg:parameter:f_a3_ggh", "hepkg:parameter:f_cp_htt", "hepkg:parameter:f_lambda1", "hepkg:parameter:f_lambda1_zgamma"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:065343d1e15396d49e3df8b5", "hepkg:evidence:0a09cb118fd777022bda9ca6", "hepkg:evidence:11f2a493e6a392fd7947df42", "hepkg:evidence:12efc303538c41d184d921e7", "hepkg:evidence:2139beb39b5c223ab1482bc1", "hepkg:evidence:23ed416c4364c76511271a48", "hepkg:evidence:2527f1d02dffc8c900a4419c", "hepkg:evidence:2adcadbe01296a93e205234d", "hepkg:evidence:2bab38bf768c0057529e6c63", "hepkg:evidence:2d4cc74c34870bedf49075bb", "hepkg:evidence:4071e9edc67f7fb3c5642811", "hepkg:evidence:46430b154761a36855ff826b", "hepkg:evidence:55f48bab92c6be1b618ba7d1", "hepkg:evidence:5