{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-34ac4277", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which background-estimation methods does analysis 2308.02285 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2308.02285 uses the following background-estimation methods:\n\n- Best linear unbiased estimator (BLUE) combination of channel measurements\n- OS-SS (opposite-sign minus same-sign) statistical subtraction technique\n- Tag-and-probe method for lepton efficiency measurement\n- Unfolding of measurements to particle and parton levels\n\nThese methods are used to estimate and correct for backgrounds in the analysis. \n\nAnswered from the graph.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2308.02285 uses the following background-estimation methods:\\n\\n- Best linear unbiased estimator (BLUE) combination of channel measurements\\n- OS-SS (opposite-sign minus same-sign) statistical subtraction technique\\n- Tag-and-probe method for lepton efficiency measurement\\n- Unfolding of measurements to particle and parton levels\\n\\nThese methods are used to estimate and correct for backgrounds in the analysis.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2308.02285"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2308.02285"], "predicate": "result_uses_statistical_method"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:method:blue-combination", "hepkg:method:os-ss-subtraction", "hepkg:method:tag-and-probe", "hepkg:method:unfolding-particle-parton"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:115ef4bbe5be0be81a9b3e7a", "hepkg:evidence:85e767fc95ca39a676cf323b", "hepkg:evidence:dd6a9db1a7123c53d2086e23", "hepkg:evidence:f1f317187c1419af9232ee95"], "seen_values": ["2308.02285", "and", "best", "blue", "channel", "combination", "efficiency", "estimator", "for", "hepkg:method:blue-combination", "hepkg:method:os-ss-subtraction", "hepkg:method:tag-and-probe", "hepkg:method:unfolding-particle-parton", "lepton", "levels", "linear", "measurement", "measurements", "method", "minus", "opposite-sign", "os-ss", "particle", "parton", "result_uses_statistical_method", "same-sign", "statistical", "statistical_method", "subtraction", "tag-and-probe", "technique", "unbiased", "unfolding"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 8947, "completion_tokens": 259, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 12.296198644209653, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 12.296198644209653, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9206.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "retrieved_label_recall": 0.0, "retrieved_entities": 4.0, "mentioned_label_recall": 0.0, "truncation_loss_labels": 0.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 4.0, "evidence_quotes": 4.0}}
{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-34d90694", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many region selection requirements does analysis 2001.06899 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2001.06899 defines 8 region selection requirements:\n\n- CSVv2 medium operating point: ~10% (60%) tagging efficiency for c (b) jets, 1% light-jet misidentification\n- Discrimination criteria of c jet versus light jets applied, yielding ~40% light-jet purity\n- Identified W/top jet candidates must pass the jet HF tagging requirement\n- Same kinematic requirements (pT, eta, dilepton invariant mass) as the reconstructed-level Z+jets baseline selection\n- Tighter lepton isolation: other activity <15% of lepton pT (instead of 25%)\n- Trigger pT thresholds: 23 and 13 GeV (electron channel); 17 and 8 GeV (muon channel)\n- \\( p_T^{\\text{miss}} < 40 \\) GeV\n- \\( |d_{xy}| < 0.05 \\) cm and \\( |d_z| < 0.2 \\) cm w.r.t. primary vertex\n\nThese requirements are directly quoted from the paper.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2001.06899 defines 8 region selection requirements, as follows:\\n\\n- CSVv2 medium operating point: ~10% (60%) tagging efficiency for c (b) jets, 1% light-jet misidentification\\n- Discrimination criteria of c jet versus light jets applied, yielding ~40% light-jet purity\\n- Identified W/top jet candidates must pass the jet HF tagging requirement\\n- Same kinematic requirements (pT, eta, dilepton invariant mass) as the reconstructed-level Z+jets baseline selection\\n- Tighter lepton isolation: other activity <15% of lepton pT (instead of 25%)\\n- Trigger pT thresholds: 23 and 13 GeV (electron channel); 17 and 8 GeV (muon channel)\\n- \\( p_T^{\\text{miss}} < 40 \\) GeV\\n- \\( |d_{xy}| < 0.05 \\) cm and \\( |d_z| < 0.2 \\) cm w.r.t. primary vertex\\n\\nThese requirements are directly quoted from the paper.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2001.06899"], "predicate": "region_has_selection"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.064}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:124f6458f2cfa6219e3dbbf4", "hepkg:evidence:50b2f0038178fd210b64f296", "hepkg:evidence:5f9091d61f2b8b527c273a5c", "hepkg:evidence:671fd9817fd858d58e3cb4ee", "hepkg:evidence:683e6b6f6a19a72526419ffd", "hepkg:evidence:6d51c63569d1c35d180a72f4", "hepkg:evidence:94694d509f2b9c7539b50243", "hepkg:evidence:ba6af461b8444b547387f75c"], "seen_values": ["0.05", "0.2", "1", "10", "13", "15", "17", "2001.06899", "23", "25", "4", "40", "6", "60", "8", "activity", "and", "applied", "baseline", "candidates", "channel", "criteria", "csvv2", "d_xy", "d_z", "dilepton", "discrimination", "efficiency", "electron", "eta", "for", "gev", "identified", "instead", "invariant", "isolation", "jet", "jets", "kinematic", "lepton", "light", "light-jet", "mass", "medium", "misidentification", "miss", "muon", "must", "none", "operating", "other", "p_t", "pass", "point", "primary", "purity", "reconstructed-level", "region_has_selection", "requirement", "requirements", "same", "selection", "tagging", "the", "thresholds", "tighter", "top", "trigger", "versus", "vertex", "yielding"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9174, "completion_tokens": 551, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 19.745879976078868, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 19.745879976078868, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9725.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 0.0, "