{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-35302be1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which backgrounds does analysis 2211.08028 estimate?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2211.08028 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- $t\\bar{t}$ background\n- Diboson background\n- Multijet background\n- Single top quark background (s-, t-, tW channels)\n- W+jets background\n- Z+jets background\n- $t\\bar{t} + W/Z/H$ background\n- $t\\bar{t}\\bar{t}\\bar{t}$ background\n\nThese backgrounds are estimated to account for various sources of non-signal events in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2111.08340", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2308.02285", "2404.06204", "2506.13565", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2211.08028"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:diboson", "hepkg:background:multijet", "hepkg:background:single-top", "hepkg:background:ttbar", "hepkg:background:ttbar-w-z-h", "hepkg:background:tttt", "hepkg:background:w-jets", "hepkg:background:z-jets"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:82e30f54c6b9a69a0d43cb6c", "hepkg:evidence:de0d06ba647ee1ee499deac8", "hepkg:evidence:e100f2738dce026a077fb5ae", "hepkg:evidence:f46721db817e8357f6c9f571", "hepkg:evidence:f58fc09dfcfaec423c6da938"], "seen_values": ["2211.08028", "background", "bar", "channels", "diboson", "hepkg:background:diboson", "hepkg:background:multijet", "hepkg:background:single-top", "hepkg:background:ttbar", "hepkg:background:ttbar-w-z-h", "hepkg:background:tttt", "hepkg:background:w-jets", "hepkg:background:z-jets", "jets", "multijet", "quark", "result_estimates_backgro