{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-38a9a2d2", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many observables does analysis 2004.01678 measure?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2004.01678 measures 4 observables:\n\n1. \\( \\sigma(pp \\to H) \\times B(H \\to Z J/\\psi) \\)\n2. \\( \\sigma(pp \\to H) \\times B(H \\to Za), B(a \\to gg) = 100\\% \\)\n3. \\( \\sigma(pp \\to H) \\times B(H \\to Za), B(a \\to \\bar{s}\\bar{s}) = 100\\% \\)\n4. \\( \\sigma(pp \\to H) \\times B(H \\to Z \\eta_c) \\)\n\nThese are the observables measured by the analysis as recorded in the graph.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2004.01678 measures 4 observables:\\n\\n1. \\( \\\\sigma(pp \\\\to H) \\\\times B(H \\\\to Z J/\\\\psi) \\)\\n2. \\( \\\\sigma(pp \\\\to H) \\\\times B(H \\\\to Za), B(a \\\\to gg) = 100\\\\% \\)\\n3. \\( \\\\sigma(pp \\\\to H) \\\\times B(H \\\\to Za), B(a \\\\to \\\\bar{s}\\\\bar{s}) = 100\\\\% \\)\\n4. \\( \\\\sigma(pp \\\\to H) \\\\times B(H \\\\to Z \\\\eta_c) \\)\\n\\nThese are the observables measured by the analysis as recorded in the graph.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2004.01678"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:xsec-br-h-to-z-etac", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-h-to-z-jpsi", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-h-to-za-gg", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-h-to-za-ss"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:7e921623cac7e5353888dbf1", "hepkg:evidence:a09dfb0acc993fdcaf93da8f"], "seen_values": ["1", "100", "2004.01678", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-h-to-z-etac", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-h-to-z-jpsi", "hepkg:observab