{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-3aa6d2d6", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many observables does analysis 2012.03799 measure?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2012.03799 measures 4 observables:\n\n1. 95% CL exclusion on spin-0 mediator mass and DM-SM coupling strength g for a fixed dark-matter particle mass.\n2. 95% CL expected/observed exclusion contour in the stop mass vs neutralino mass (or mass-splitting) plane for direct stop pair production.\n3. Per-signal-region observed event yield, predicted SM background, background-only compatibility (p0, local Z significance), and model-independent 95% CL upper limit on the number of beyond-SM events.\n4. Upper limit on the ratio of the spin-0 mediator production cross-section to the theoretical prediction, as a function of mediator mass.\n\nThese observables are supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n1. '95% CL exclusion on spin-0 mediator mass and DM-SM coupling strength g for a fixed dark-matter particle mass'\n2. '95% CL expected/observed exclusion contour in the stop mass vs neutralino mass (or mass-splitting) plane for direct stop pair production'\n3. 'Per-signal-region observed event yield, predicted SM background, background-only compatibility (p0, local Z significance), and model-independent 95% CL upper limit on the number of beyond-SM events'\n4. 'Upper limit on the ratio of the spin-0 mediator production cross-section to the theoretical prediction, as a function of mediator mass'\n\nTherefore, the analysis 2012.03799 measures 4 observables.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2012.03799"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2012.03799"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:dm-xsec-upper-limit-ratio", "hepkg:observable:mediator-mass-coupling-exclusion", "hepkg:observable:sr-event-yield-limit", "hepkg:observable:stop-mass-exclusion-contour"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:5841541a2eb2e49e9bf7652f", "hepkg:evidence:68958504928953b503cb7c9e", "hepkg:evidence:9f3dff03817fefc122d25a57", "hepkg:evidence:bb028c53195f78d16552a740"], "seen_values": ["0", "2012.03799", "95", "and", "background", "background-only", "beyond-sm", "compatibility", "contour", "coupling", "cross-section", "dark-matter", "direct", "dm-sm", "event", "events", "exclusion", "expected", "fixed", "for", "function", "hepkg:observable:dm-xsec-upper-limit-ratio", "hepkg:observable:mediator-mass-coupling-exclusion", "hepkg:observable:sr-event-yield-limit", "hepkg:observable:stop-mass-exclusion-contour", "limit", "local", "mass", "mass-splitting", "mediator", "model-independent", "neutralino", "number", "observable", "observed", "pair", "particle", "per-signal-region", "plane", "predicted", "prediction", "production", "ratio", "result_measures_observable", "significance", "spin-0", "stop", "strength", "the", "theoretical", "upper", "yield"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9013, "completion_tokens": 744, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 26.36489871935919, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 26.36489871935919, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9757.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 4.0, "evidence_quotes": 4.0}}
{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-3aafe5fb", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many distinct detector objects do the regions of analysis 2109.13808 require?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The regions of analysis 2109.13808 require 3 distinct detector objects: Jet, Lepton (electron or muon), and b-tagged jet.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2403.01556", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2109.13808"], "predicate": "region_requires_object"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:bjet", "hepkg:object:jet", "hepkg:object:lepton"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:3b3206a83dedac73b4e0ec0d", "hepkg:evidence:68e6c59cead1dcf66e7a8476", "hepkg:evidence:6f234ee78f0028a8b41f7809", "hepkg:evidence:bb554dd75d65a5a075112878", "hepkg:evidence:bc69abfdc6eccb8a4ca88e4d", "hepkg:evidence:df5704a508713a64e5fe8bbd", "hepkg:evidence:f69e82d52a97b92dab7bf9a0"], "seen_values": ["2109.13808", "b-tagged", "detector_object", "electron", "hepkg:object:bjet", "hepkg:object:jet", "hepkg:object:lepton", "jet", "lepton", "muon", "region_requires_object"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 8831, "completion_tokens": 163, "r