{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-3d9f79a1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which detector objects does analysis 2207.12246 define?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2207.12246 defines the following detector objects:\n\n- Elastic-scattering candidate event\n- Reconstructed track (ALFA main detector)\n\nThese definitions are supported by the following evidence from the paper:\n\n- For the elastic-scattering candidate event: 'Elastic-scattering candidate events are selected based on the presence of a single reconstructed track in each of the ALFA detectors.'\n- For the reconstructed track (ALFA main detector): 'Reconstructed tracks in the ALFA main detector are used to identify the interaction point and to measure the scattering angle.'", "answered": true, "papers": ["2207.12246"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2207.12246"], "predicate": "result_defines_object"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.041}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:alfa_track", "hepkg:object:elastic_event_candidate"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:84506845049a8d64170ef1b4", "hepkg:evidence:8a601544238d300472771b76", "hepkg:evidence:de582882d9c86442557f9f3c"], "seen_values": ["2207.12246", "alfa", "candidate", "detector", "detector_object", "elastic-scattering", "event", "hepkg:object:alfa_track", "hepkg:object:elastic_event_candidate", "main", "reconstructed", "result_defines_object", "track"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 8780, "completion_tokens": 334, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 12.086226476822048, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 12.086226476822048, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9114.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0