{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-3e697e1f", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2007.02873 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2007.02873 defines 12 object selection requirements:\n\n- Tight likelihood requirement plus calorimeter-based isolation in addition to track-based isolation\n- Medium quality criterion and stricter track isolation requirement\n- Jet Vertex Tagger applied to remove pile-up jets with \\( p_T < 120 \\) GeV and \\( |\\eta| < 2.5 \\) not associated with the primary vertex\n- MV2 discriminant tuned to 70% average b-jet efficiency in simulated \\( t\\bar{t} \\) events (light-flavour mis-tag 0.3%, c-jet mis-tag 12.5%), applied in the central region\n- Leading b-tagged jet required to have \\( p_T > 45 \\) GeV\n- One tight electron with \\( p_T > 27 \\) GeV, no additional loose leptons (1-lepton channel)\n- One tight muon with \\( p_T > 25 \\) GeV, no additional loose leptons (1-lepton channel)\n- \\( p_T > 20 \\) GeV for \\( |\\eta| < 2.5 \\) (central region); \\( p_T > 30 \\) GeV for \\( 2.5 < |\\eta| < 4.5 \\) (outside tracker acceptance)\n- \\( p_T > 20 \\) GeV, \\( |\\eta| < 2.5 \\) excluding \\( 1.37 < |\\eta| < 1.52 \\), medium quality criterion\n- \\( p_T > 7 \\) GeV, \\( |\\eta| < 2.47 \\), small impact parameters, loose track isolation, LooseLH quality (loose working point)\n- Two same-flavour loose leptons required, leading lepton \\( p_T > 27 \\) GeV, dilepton mass near Z boson mass (2-lepton channel)\n- \\( |\\eta| < 2.7 \\) (muon spectrometer acceptance), \\( p_T > 7 \\) GeV, small impact parameters, loose quality criterion, loose track isolation (loose working point)\n\nThese requirements are supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n- \"TightLH likelihood requirement plus calorimeter-based isolation in addition to track-based isolation\"\n- \"Medium quality criterion and stricter track isolation requirement\"\n- \"Jet Vertex Tagger applied to remove pile-up jets with pT < 120 GeV and |eta| < 2.5 not associated with the primary vertex\"\n- \"MV2 discriminant tuned to 70% average b-jet efficiency in simulated ttbar events (light-flavour mis-tag 0.3%, c-jet mis-tag 12.5%), applied in central region\"\n- \"Leading b-tagged jet required to have pT > 45 GeV\"\n- \"One tight electron with pT > 27 GeV, no additional loose leptons (1-lepton channel)\"\n- \"One tight muon with pT > 25 GeV, no additional loose leptons (1-lepton channel)\"\n- \"pT > 20 GeV for |eta| < 2.5 (central region); pT > 30 GeV for 2.5 < |eta| < 4.5 (outside tracker acceptance)\"\n- \"pT > 20 GeV, |eta| < 2.5 excluding 1.37 < |eta| < 1.52, 'medium' quality criterion\"\n- \"pT > 7 GeV, |eta| < 2.47, small impact parameters, loose track isolation, 'LooseLH' quality (loose working point)\"\n- \"Two same", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2007.02873"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:1f6da492344773d267c033e8", "hepkg:evidence:448b2bc86687561e2aaf228e", "hepkg:evidence:46144e29f977dba4702f626b", "hepkg:evidence:56f77f3514fcad9f73aa2800", "hepkg:evidence:6b82ce47f0b4ef5a3e678a03", "hepkg:evidence:8d98140c5918f5f40a7df397", "hepkg:evidence:98607c8eefbbba61adb0fd2c", "hepkg:evidence:ac0922ce87b466058ce43386", "hepkg:evidence:ecd2be205d2812a31675c5ca", "hepkg:evidence:f6618294bb70f257684e435f", "hepkg:evidence:f886c17f2abe80813f8ef30d"], "seen_values": ["-lepton", "0.3", "1", "1.37", "1.52", "12", "12.5", "120", "2", "2.47", "2.5", "2.7", "20", "2007.02873", "25", "27", "3", "30", "4.5", "45", "7", "70", "acceptance", "addition", "additional", "and", "applied", "associated", "average", "b-jet", "b-tagged", "boson", "c-jet", "calorimeter-based", "central", "channel", "criterion", "dilepton", "discriminant", "efficiency", "electron", "eta", "events", "excluding", "for", "gev", "have", "impact", "isolation", "jet", "jets", "leading", "lepton", "leptons", "light-flavour", "likelihood", "loose", "looselh", "mass", "medium", "mis-tag", "muon", "mv2", "near", "none", "not", "object_has_selection", "one", "outside", "parameters", "pile-up", "plus", "point", "primary", "quality", "region", "remove", "required", "requirement", "same-flavour", "simulated", "small", "spectrometer", "stricter", "tagger", "the", "tight", "tightlh", "track", "track-based", "tracker", "ttbar", "tuned", "two", "vertex", "with", "working"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9536, "completion_tokens": 838, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 28.18806664319709, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 28.18806664319709, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 10374.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 0.0, "evidence_quotes": 11.0}}
