{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-43db3120", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many quantities does analysis 2004.01678 report?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2004.01678 reports 22 distinct quantities. These include upper limits on the production cross section times branching ratio for \\(H \\rightarrow Z\\alpha\\) at various masses of \\(\\alpha\\), the expected and observed signal yields, the total background uncertainty, and the data-driven background estimate in the signal region. \n\nHere are some examples:\n\n- 95% CL upper limit on \\(\\sigma(pp \\rightarrow H) \\times B(H \\rightarrow Za)\\) for \\(\\alpha\\) masses ranging from 0.5 GeV to 4.0 GeV.\n- Expected and observed 95% CL upper limits for \\(H \\rightarrow Z\\eta_c\\) and \\(H \\rightarrow ZJ/\\psi\\).\n- Total background uncertainty in the signal region: 3700 events.\n- Data-driven background estimate in the signal region: 82400 events with a statistical uncertainty of 2900 events.\n- Observed data yield in the signal region: 82908 events.\n\nThese quantities provide a comprehensive overview of the analysis results.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2004.01678 reports 22 distinct quantities. These include upper limits on the production cross section times branching ratio for \\(H \\\\rightarrow Z\\\\alpha\\) at various masses of \\(\\alpha\\), the expected and observed signal yields, the total background uncertainty, and the data-driven background estimate in the signal region. Here are some examples:\\n\\n- 95% CL upper limit on \\(\\sigma(pp \\\\rightarrow H) \\\\times B(H \\\\rightarrow Za)\\) for \\(\\alpha\\) masses ranging from 0.5 GeV to 4.0 GeV.\\n- Expected and observed 95% CL upper limits for \\(H \\\\rightarrow Z\\\\eta_c\\) and \\(H \\\\rightarrow ZJ/\\\\psi\\).\\n- Total background uncertainty in the signal region: 3700 events.\\n- Data-driven background estimate in the signal region: 82400 events with a statistical uncertainty of 2900 events.\\n- Observed data yield in the signal region: 82908 events.\\n\\nThese quantities provide a comprehensive overview of the analysis results.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2004.01678"], "predicate": "result_reports_quantity"}, "rows": 21, "error": null, "seconds": 0.057}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:02d1f455fea71f833136c037", "hepkg:evidence:138bdc46c4039abf625216fc", "hepkg:evidence:13f040993dd56166e7846cc3", "hepkg:evidence:16f6f7c4866e0cdebd2d5f05", "hepkg:evidence:282e8c2cbd4b6622b36dbcbf", "hepkg:evidence:2d61a876c0281461c972122f", "hepkg:evidence:3265f66e4bb5bc53691693f1", "hepkg:evidence:4587fc1aa6f6ac044a9d7716", "hepkg:evidence:6873b30a59a5d8fa4df62bed", "hepkg:evidence:76e651fc31c02dda74afd634", "hepkg:evidence:93a468af28f2b2514f308046", "hepkg:evidence:a0c8555012e8a6c89228cfd6", "hepkg:evidence:a875cf6394f949e2b2aa2688", "hepkg:evidence:b77cff3dcb6ee1f864f283ae", "hepkg:evidence:b8aa150d58d46e2f139d8fc3", "hepkg:evidence:c213dd4a4e4752016c58ca32"], "seen_values": ["0.5", "0.75", "1", "1.0", "1.5", "1.9", "10", "100", "109", "1090", "11", "110", "12", "120", "13", "130", "15", "16", "17", "18", "19", "2", "2.0", "2.5", "20", "2004.01678", "21", "22", "23", "2300", "24", "25", "256", "25600", "26", "27", "29", "2900", "3", "3.0", "3.5", "30", "32", "320", "33", "34", "340", "37", "3700", "38", "4", "4.0", "40", "426", "4260", "437", "4370", "5", "55", "6", "65", "68", "7", "75", "78", "8", "824", "82400", "82908", "9", "90", "95", "a_mass_gev", "a_to_gg", "a_to_ss", "across", "all", "and", "assuming", "background", "breakdown", "cross", "data", "data-driven", "data_mc_statistics", "err_down", "err_up