{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-4455b19d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2112.00895 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2112.00895 defines 16 object selection requirements:\n\n- 3D displacement significance > 3.5\n- IPS (impact parameter significance) > 1\n- SV charge != 0 required for OS/SS classification (event rejected if non-zero charge cannot be assigned)\n- constituent track pT > 1 GeV\n- corrected SV mass m_SV^corr > 0.55 GeV\n- dimuon mass > 12 GeV\n- dimuon mass veto: exclude 70 < m_mumu < 110 GeV\n- fiducial parton-level: pT^l > 30 GeV; |eta^l| < 2.1\n- pT > 30 GeV; |eta| < 2.1; isolated (see electron/muon specific isolation cuts)\n- pT^c > 25 GeV; |eta^c| < 2.5; ΔR(c, lepton) > 0.5\n- pT^jet > 25 GeV; |eta^jet| < 2.5; ΔR(jet, lepton) > 0.5; anti-kT R=0.5\n- transverse mass m_T > 55 GeV (m_T = sqrt(2 pT^l pT^miss [1-cos(phi_l-phi_miss)]))\n- trigger pT > 24 GeV; combined isolation I_comb/pT < 0.12 (cone dR<0.4)\n- trigger pT > 27 GeV; combined isolation I_comb/pT < 0.15 (cone dR<0.3)\n- veto if second isolated lepton pT > 20 GeV, |eta| < 2.1, opposite charge to W lepton\n- |eta| < 2.1; pT < 25 GeV; pT/pT^jet < 0.6; non-isolated I_comb/pT > 0.2\n\nThese requirements are directly quoted from the paper.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2112.00895 defines 16 object selection requirements, as listed above.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2112.00895"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 16, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:196ce3591edb5a9f4442c43c", "hepkg:evidence:3543afe