{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-45ce27e1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many region selection requirements does analysis 2403.01556 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2403.01556 defines 19 region selection requirements. Here are the details:\n\n- \\(\\geq10\\%\\) of associated tracks with \\(|d_z|\\) from PV < 0.01 cm\n- Additional jet fails DeepJet b tagging at loose working point\n- Additional jet passes DeepJet b tagging at medium working point\n- GNN (aGNN) EJ tagging score in [0,1] with track-jet association radius \\(R_{\\text{max}}=0.8\\)\n- GNN (uGNN) EJ tagging score in [0,1] with track-jet association radius \\(R_{\\text{max}}=0.8\\)\n- GNN score in a region disjoint from SR\n- \\(H_T\\) and EJ tagging thresholds optimized per signal model\n- \\(H_T\\) and jet \\(p_T\\) requirements relaxed relative to SR\n- \\(H_T\\) requirement inverted relative to SR to ensure orthogonality\n- High \\(H_T\\) and \\(\\geq4\\) jets, \\(\\geq2\\) of which tagged as EJs\n- High-pT photon trigger, isolated photon \\(p_T > 200\\) GeV in ECAL barrel, 1 or 2 jets\n- Identical event/jet kinematic requirements to SR but exactly one EJ-tagged jet\n- PV within 15 cm of detector center in \\(z\\)\n- Signal contamination <1%\n- Track-jet association radius \\(R_{\\text{max}}=0.4\\) for unflavored model-agnostic EJ tagging\n- Track-jet association radius \\(R_{\\text{max}}=0.8\\) for flavor-aligned model-agnostic EJ tagging\n- Validation EJ tagger based on a-tag 1 with one requirement relaxed\n- Validation EJ tagger based on u-tag 1 with one requirement relaxed\n\nThese requirements are used to define the regions in the analysis. \n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2403.01556"], "predica