{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-4c0139a9", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which physics processes does analysis 2012.03799 target?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2012.03799 targets the following physics processes:\n\n- Direct stop pair production: \\( pp \\rightarrow \\tilde{t}_1 \\tilde{t}_1^* \\)\n- Four-body stop decay: \\( \\tilde{t}_1 \\rightarrow b f f' \\tilde{\\chi}_1^0 \\)\n- Three-body stop decay: \\( \\tilde{t}_1 \\rightarrow b W \\tilde{\\chi}_1^0 \\)\n- Two-body stop decay: \\( \\tilde{t}_1 \\rightarrow t + \\tilde{\\chi}_1^0 \\)\n- \\( pp \\rightarrow t \\bar{t} + \\) spin-0 mediator (\\( \\phi/a \\rightarrow \\chi \\bar{\\chi} \\))\n\nThese processes are detailed in the paper.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2012.03799 targets the following physics processes:\\n\\n- Direct stop pair production: \\( pp \\\\rightarrow \\\\tilde{t}_1 \\\\tilde{t}_1^* \\)\\n- Four-body stop decay: \\( \\\\tilde{t}_1 \\\\rightarrow b f f' \\\\tilde{\\\\chi}_1^0 \\)\\n- Three-body stop decay: \\( \\\\tilde{t}_1 \\\\rightarrow b W \\\\tilde{\\\\chi}_1^0 \\)\\n- Two-body stop decay: \\( \\\\tilde{t}_1 \\\\rightarrow t + \\\\tilde{\\\\chi}_1^0 \\)\\n- \\( pp \\\\rightarrow t \\\\bar{t} + \\\\) spin-0 mediator (\\( \\\\phi/a \\\\rightarrow \\\\chi \\\\bar{\\\\chi} \\)\\)\\n\\nThese processes are detailed in the paper.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}", "answered": true, "papers": ["2012.03799", "2102.01444"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2012.03799"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.021}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:stop-decay-2body", "hepkg:process:stop-decay-3body", "hepkg:process:stop-decay-4body", "hepkg:process:stop-pai