{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-4fcefe64", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many region selection requirements does analysis 2604.21670 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2604.21670 defines 12 region selection requirements:\n\n- \\(120 < m_J < 220 \\, \\text{GeV}\\)\n- \\(200 < m_T^W < 5000 \\, \\text{GeV}\\)\n- \\(66 < m_{ll} < 116 \\, \\text{GeV} \\, (\\text{same-flavour opposite-sign pair})\\)\n- \\(E_T/m_{\\gamma\\gamma} > 0.25 \\, (\\text{subleading photon})\\)\n- \\(E_T/m_{\\gamma\\gamma} > 0.35 \\, (\\text{leading photon})\\)\n- \\(m_T^W > 30 \\, \\text{GeV}\\)\n- \\(m_{jj} > 1000 \\, \\text{GeV}, m_{ll} \\in (81,101) \\, \\text{GeV}\\)\n- \\(m_{ll} > 55 \\, \\text{GeV}\\)\n- \\(m_{\\tau\\tau}^{\\text{vis}} > 100 \\, \\text{GeV}\\)\n- \\(p_T(\\text{leading lepton}) > 27 \\, \\text{GeV}\\)\n- \\(p_T(\\text{subleading lepton}) > 25 \\, \\text{GeV}\\)\n- \\(|\\eta(\\text{lepton})| < 2.5\\)\n\nThese requirements are used to define the regions in the analysis.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2604.21670 defines 12 region selection requirements. These include: 120 < m_J < 220 GeV, 200 < m_T^W < 5000 GeV, 66 < m_ll < 116 GeV (same-flavour opposite-sign pair), E_T/m_gammagamma > 0.25 (subleading photon), E_T/m_gammagamma > 0.35 (leading photon), m_T^W > 30 GeV, m_jj > 1000 GeV, m_ll in (81,101) GeV, m_ll > 55 GeV, m_tautau_vis > 100 GeV, pT(leading lepton) > 27 GeV, pT(subleading lepton) > 25 GeV, |eta(lepton)| < 2.5.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2604.21670"], "predicate": "region_has_selection"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.102}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["