{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-50622095", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2508.13900 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2508.13900 measures the following observables:\n\n1. **Distribution of post-fit z-scores per analysis bin for the background-only fit**\n2. **Model-independent superbin event counts: \\( N_{\\text{obs}} \\), \\( N_{\\text{pred\\_bkg}} \\), \\( \\sigma(N_{\\text{pred\\_bkg}}) \\), and \\( S_{\\text{UL}}^{95\\%} \\) signal-strength upper limits**\n3. **Upper limit on \\( \\sigma(\\chi_1^+ \\chi_1^-) \\times \\text{BR} \\) for TChiSlepSnu decay chain at 95% CL vs (mass, \\( \\Delta m \\)), wino-like couplings**\n4. **Upper limit on \\( \\sigma(\\chi_1^+ \\chi_1^-) \\times \\text{BR}^2(\\chi_1^\\pm \\to W \\chi_1^0) \\) at 95% CL vs (mass, \\( \\Delta m \\)), wino-like couplings**\n5. **Upper limit on \\( \\sigma(\\chi_1^\\pm \\chi_2^0) \\times \\text{BR}(\\chi_1^\\pm \\to W \\chi_1^0) \\times \\text{BR}(\\chi_2^0 \\to Z \\chi_1^0) \\) at 95% CL vs (mass, \\( \\Delta m \\)), wino- and higgsino-like couplings**\n6. **Upper limit on \\( \\sigma(\\text{slepton} \\text{slepton}) \\times \\text{BR}^2(\\text{slepton} \\to \\text{lepton} \\chi_1^0) \\) at 95% CL vs (m(slepton), \\( \\Delta m \\)), for LL-only, RR-only, and combined chirality, selectron/smuon/combined flavor**\n7. **Upper limit on \\( \\sigma(\\text{stop} \\text{stop}) \\times \\text{BR}^2(\\text{stop} \\to b \\chi_1^+) \\times \\text{BR}^2(\\chi_1^+ \\to W^+ \\chi_1^0) \\) at 95% CL vs (m(stop), \\( \\Delta m \\))**\n8. **Upper limit on \\( \\sigma(\\text{stop} \\text{stop}) \\times \\text{BR}^2(\\text{stop} \\to c \\chi_1^0) \\) at 95% CL vs (m(stop), \\( \\Delta m \\))**\n9. **Upper limit on \\( \\sigma(\\text{stop} \\text{stop}) \\times \\text{BR}^2(\\text{stop} \\to t \\chi_1^0) \\) at 95% CL vs (m(stop), \\( \\Delta m \\))**\n\nThese observables cover a range of measurements related to supersymmetric particle production and decay.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2508.13900"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2508.13900"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:postfit-zscore", "hepkg:observable:superbin-yields", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-t2bw", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-t2cc", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-t2tt", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-tchislepsnu", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-tchiww", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-tchiwz", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-tslepslep"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:27da35f44fc60815007b5301", "hepkg:evidence:4468a6b133c70b55e87acca8", "hepkg:evidence:62263e17b68720276aecdd61", "hepkg:evidence:64ee13ab2e4cf42b08ddfd85", "hepkg:evidence:652b44531fdbe2c760bd990e", "hepkg:evidence:7a41ea787d44d6df2795632d", "hepkg:evidence:ec8e277445b72a6488fc9adc"], "seen_values": ["2", "2508.139", "2508.13900", "95", "analysis", "and", "background-only", "bin", "chain", "chi1", "chi1-", "chi10", "chi1pm", "chi1pm-", "chi20", "chi20-", "chirality", "combined", "counts", "couplings", "decay", "delta", "distribution", "event", "fit", "flavor", "for", "hepkg:observable:postfit-zscore", "hepkg:observable:superbin-yields", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-t2bw", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-t2cc", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-t2tt", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-tchislepsnu", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-tchiww", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-tchiwz", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-tslepslep", "higgsino-like", "lepton", "limit", "limits", "ll-only", "mass", "model-independent", "n_obs", "n_pred_bkg", "observable", "per", "post-fit", "result_measures_observable", "rr-only", "s_ul", "selectron", "sigma", "signal-strength", "slepton", "slepton-", "smuon", "stop", "superbin", "tchislepsnu", "the", "upper", "wino-", "wino-like"