{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-5093e37a", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which backgrounds does analysis 2009.04363 estimate?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2009.04363 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- Diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background process\n- Drell-Yan (DY) background process\n- Electroweak Z+2jets (Zjj-EW) background process\n- Single top quark background process\n- Triboson background process\n- ttZ (and associated top+boson) background process\n- ttbar background process\n\nThese backgrounds are estimated in the context of the analysis reported in the paper with arXiv ID 2009.04363.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2009.04363"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2009.04363"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:diboson-background", "hepkg:process:drell-yan-background", "hepkg:process:single-top-background", "hepkg:process:triboson-background", "hepkg:process:ttbar-background", "hepkg:process:ttz-background", "hepkg:process:zjj-ew-background"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:091b989f1a8a94dbe01a9a21", "hepkg:evidence:19ac5e73d37020de9a378f09", "hepkg:evidence:466602fc1571ac20bfdb81b5", "hepkg:evidence:66d65b8313d0df513ebd8ac4", "hepkg:evidence:805965effa6ac64193252c85", "hepkg:evidence:983ea329776f70a550a0e2fc", "hepkg:evidence:b8d1f1a7053a51d211e3bbd4", "hepkg:evidence:c6c18a430ff0cbaca6538e69"], "seen_values": ["2", "2009.04363", "and", "associated", "background", "boson", "diboson", "drell-yan", "electroweak", "hepkg:process:diboson-background", "hepkg:process:drell-yan-background", "hepkg:process:single-top-background", "hepkg:process:triboson-background", "hepkg:process:ttbar-background", "hepkg:process:ttz-background", "hepkg:pro