{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-52a16d4c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which detector objects do the regions of analysis 2012.08600 require?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The regions of analysis 2012.08600 require the following detector objects:\n\n- Jet\n- Large-radius jet (boosted H→bb analysis)\n- Lepton (electron or muon)\n- b-tagged jet\n\nThis information is supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n- For Jets: \"Jets are reconstructed using the anti-kt algorithm with a radius parameter of 0.4.\"\n- For Large-radius jets: \"Large-radius jets are reconstructed using the anti-kt algorithm with a radius parameter of 1.0.\"\n- For Leptons: \"Leptons (electrons and muons) are required to satisfy identification criteria and isolation requirements.\"\n- For b-tagged jets: \"b-tagged jets are identified using the MV2c10 algorithm.\"", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2403.01556", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2012.08600"], "predicate": "region_requires_object"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.042}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:bjet", "hepkg:object:jet", "hepkg:object:large_radius_jet", "hepkg:object:lepton"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:12e8ea