{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-52af68ce", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which detector objects does analysis 2304.08962 define?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2304.08962 defines the following detector objects:\n\n- **Di-charmonium (4mu) candidate**\n- **J/psi candidate (mass-constrained di-muon vertex)**\n- **Muon**\n- **Primary vertex (PV)**\n- **psi(2S) candidate (mass-constrained di-muon vertex)**\n\nThese definitions are directly stated in the paper.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2304.08962"], "predicate": "result_defines_object"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:dicharmonium_candidate", "hepkg:object:jpsi_candidate", "hepkg:object:muon", "hepkg:object:primary_vertex", "hepkg:object:psi2s_candidate"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:2c9c80af3caa689cfd4b7a0d", "hepkg:evidence:42c8098836c6440497bf7f86", "hepkg:evidence:6cdcee615c6e77ff079e1393", "hepkg:evidence:7e076adf0d3e160725f9e080"], "seen_values": ["2", "2304.08962", "4", "candidate", "detector_object", "di-charmonium", "di-muon", "hepkg:object:dicharmonium_can