{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-52c2e07c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many region selection requirements does analysis 2004.01678 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2004.01678 defines a total of 35 region selection requirements across its various event regions. These include selections on variables such as \\( m_{llj} \\), \\( M \\), \\( m_{ll} \\), \\( p_T^{ll} \\), and others, as detailed in the paper. \n\nHere are some examples of the selection requirements:\n- \\( m_{llj} < 250 \\) GeV\n- \\( 120 \\) GeV \\( < m_{llj} < 135 \\) GeV\n- \\( M > 0.0524 \\)\n- \\( 0.0341 < M < 0.0524 \\)\n- \\( 155 \\) GeV \\( < m_{llj} < 175 \\) GeV\n- \\( m_{ll} > 20 \\) GeV and \\( m_{ll} \\) not in \\([70, 105]\\) GeV\n- \\( p_T^{ll} < 5 \\) GeV\n- Exactly two same-flavor opposite-charge leptons, matched to trigger\n- \\( \\text{vertex\\_chi2\\_ndof} < 5.0 \\)\n- \\( \\text{vertex\\_mass\\_and\\_pT} > 4 \\) GeV, \\( p_T > 8 \\) GeV\n- \\( \\text{second\\_highest\\_Sig\\_IP2D} > 15 \\)\n- \\( \\epsilon > 0.15 \\)\n- \\( zeta < 0.2 \\)\n- \\( N_{\\text{tracks\\_3D\\_leading\\_jet}} < 3 \\)\n- \\( N_{\\text{tracks\\_3D\\_subleading\\_jet}} < 3 \\)\n- \\( \\text{GBDT\\_score} > 0.988 \\)\n- \\( m_T > 150 \\) GeV\n- \\( m_{CT} > 200 \\) GeV\n- \\( m_{bb} \\) in \\([90, 150]\\) GeV\n- \\( p_T(\\text{non-b jet}) < 300 \\) GeV for 3-jet events\n\nThese requirements are applied to different regions such as the baseline preselection, modified ABCD estimate regions, and the signal region.\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2009.14537", "2012.01581", "2107.12553", "2508.13900"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2004.01678"], "predicate": "result_defines_region"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.045}, {"ro