{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-536b1387", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2208.12095 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2208.12095 defines 9 object selection requirements:\n\n- Electron\n- Large-$R$ jet (anti-$k_t$, $R=1.0$, trimmed)\n- Missing transverse momentum\n- Muon\n- Parton-level lepton (from $W$ decay, prompt)\n- Parton-level top (anti)quark\n- Primary vertex (PV)\n- Small-$R$ jet (anti-$k_t$, $R=0.4$)\n- b-tagged jet\n\nThis list is based on the direct evidence from the paper.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2208.12095 defines 9 object selection requirements, including Electron, Large-$R$ jet (anti-$k_t$, $R=1.0$, trimmed), Missing transverse momentum, Muon, Parton-level lepton (from $W$ decay, prompt), Parton-level top (anti)quark, Primary vertex (PV), Small-$R$ jet (anti-$k_t$, $R=0.4$), and b-tagged jet.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2208.12095"], "predicate"