{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-536c39b5", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2001.06899 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2001.06899 measures the following observables:\n\n- Cross section ratio \\( R(b/j) = \\sigma(Z+b\\ \\text{jets})/\\sigma(Z+\\text{jets}) \\)\n- Cross section ratio \\( R(c/b) = \\sigma(Z+c\\ \\text{jets})/\\sigma(Z+b\\ \\text{jets}) \\)\n- Cross section ratio \\( R(c/j) = \\sigma(Z+c\\ \\text{jets})/\\sigma(Z+\\text{jets}) \\)\n- MC-to-data scale factor for \\( Z+b \\) jets yield from \\( M_{SV} \\) template fit (SF_b)\n- MC-to-data scale factor for \\( Z+c \\) jets yield from \\( M_{SV} \\) template fit (SF_c)\n- \\( Z+b \\) jets event HF tagging efficiency (\\( \\epsilon^{b\\_\\text{tag}} \\))\n- \\( Z+c \\) jets event HF tagging efficiency (\\( \\epsilon^{c\\_\\text{tag}} \\))\n- \\( Z+ \\) light jets HF mistagging rate\n\nThese measurements are supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n- For \\( R(b/j) \\): \"The cross section ratio \\( R(b/j) = \\sigma(Z+b\\ \\text{jets})/\\sigma(Z+\\text{jets}) \\)\"\n- For \\( R(c/b) \\): \"The cross section ratio \\( R(c/b) = \\sigma(Z+c\\ \\text{jets})/\\sigma(Z+b\\ \\text{jets}) \\)\"\n- For \\( R(c/j) \\): \"The cross section ratio \\( R(c/j) = \\sigma(Z+c\\ \\text{jets})/\\sigma(Z+\\text{jets}) \\)\"\n- For SF_b: \"The MC-to-data scale factor for \\( Z+b \\) jets yield from \\( M_{SV} \\) template fit (SF_b)\"\n- For SF_c: \"The MC-to-data scale factor for \\( Z+c \\) jets yield from \\( M_{SV} \\) template fit (SF_c)\"\n- For \\( \\epsilon^{b\\_\\text{tag}} \\): \"The \\( Z+b \\) jets event HF tagging efficiency (\\( \\epsilon^{b\\_\\text{tag}} \\))\"\n- For \\( \\epsilon^{c\\_\\text{tag}} \\): \"The \\( Z+c \\) jets event HF tagging efficiency (\\( \\epsilon^{c\\_\\text{tag}} \\))\"\n- For the mistagging rate: \"The \\( Z+ \\) light jets HF mistagging rate\"\n\nAnswered from the graph.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2001.06899 measures the following observables:\\n\\n- Cross section ratio \\( R(b/j) = \\\\sigma(Z+b\\\\ \\\\text{jets})/\\\\sigma(Z+\\\\text{jets}) \\\\)\\n- Cross section ratio \\( R(c/b) = \\\\sigma(Z+c\\\\ \\\\text{jets})/\\\\sigma(Z+b\\\\ \\\\text{jets}) \\\\)\\n- Cross section ratio \\( R(c/j) = \\\\sigma(Z+c\\\\ \\\\text{jets})/\\\\sigma(Z+\\\\text{jets}) \\\\)\\n- MC-to-data scale factor for \\( Z+b \\\\) jets yield from \\( M_{SV} \\\\) template fit (SF_b)\\n- MC-to-data scale factor for \\( Z+c \\\\) jets yield from \\( M_{SV} \\\\) template fit (SF_c)\\n- \\( Z+b \\\\) jets event HF tagging efficiency (\\( \\\\epsilon^{b\\\\_\\\\text{tag}} \\\\))\\n- \\( Z+c \\\\) jets event HF tagging efficiency (\\( \\\\epsilon^{c\\\\_\\\\text{tag}} \\\\))\\n- \\( Z+ \\\\)", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2001.06899"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:R_b_over_j", "hepkg:observable:R_c_over_b", "hepkg:observable:R_c_over_j", "hepkg:observable:b_jet_tagging_efficiency", "hepkg:observable:c_jet_tagging_efficiency", "hepkg:observable:light_jet_mistag_rate", "hepkg:observable:scale_factor_b", "hepkg:observable:scale_factor_c"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:08f1e8d2abe9563bb8e2c78c", "hepkg:evidence:0966f04bd72c7c0cfee7677b", "hepkg:evidence:254498640c811103860acbd2", "hepkg:evidence:37cf05d621b2f47bfb9e1c29", "hepkg:evidence:53f3268dc84fcdc72a2667c7", "hepkg:evidence:5e73c4af5e3d940b53c1a8cf", "hepkg:evidence:7c631c0bd79161f6cda24eec", "hepkg:evidence:864b619502618098a1f51e1f", "hepkg:evidence:a50c72658a16da1c65cef47b", "hepkg:evidence:ac0d3ecfd64eb0889e0c5500", "hepkg:evidence:c8f9049ea3