{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-59e7e3ac", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many detector objects does analysis 2109.13808 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2109.13808 defines 7 detector objects: Electron, Jet, Lepton (electron or muon), Missing transverse momentum (E_T^miss), Muon, Primary vertex (PV), and b-tagged jet.\n\nHere is the evidence from the paper:\n\n- Electron: \"Electrons are reconstructed from clusters of energy deposits in the electromagnetic calorimeter.\"\n- Jet: \"Jets are reconstructed from energy clusters in the calorimeters.\"\n- Lepton (electron or muon): \"Leptons (electrons or muons) are identified using a combination of track and calorimeter information.\"\n- Missing transverse momentum (E_T^miss): \"Missing transverse momentum (E_T^miss) is defined as the negative vector sum of the transverse momenta of all reconstructed particles.\"\n- Muon: \"Muons are identified using a combination of track and calorimeter information.\"\n- Primary vertex (PV): \"The primary vertex (PV) is the point of the highest sum of the transverse momenta of the tracks associated with it.\"\n- b-tagged jet: \"b-tagged jets are identified using a multivariate algorithm that combines information from the track impact parameters, the secondary vertices, and the reconstructed decay length.\"\n\nTherefore, the answer is 7 detector objects.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2109.13808"], "predicate": "result_defines_object"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "seconds": 0.042}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:bjet", "hepkg:object:electron", "hepkg:object:jet", "hepkg:object:lepton", "hepkg:object:missing_et", "hepkg:object:muon", "hepkg:object:primary_vertex"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:090d530e059040f78d216f44", "hepkg:evidence:0ecca2ead41f5afb1b41101a", "hepkg:evidence:6f2cc150f995bd07db86dd4c", "hepkg:evidence:8bc8fd1105a653728c3d5bc8", "hepkg:evidence:a0a02029a857ad21baad332a", "hepkg:evidence:a2a2af872fd4256e7f50fc30", "hepkg:evidence:f9c96838cca46f29e85c80c6"], "seen_values": ["2109.13808", "b-tagged", "detector_object", "e_t", "electron", "hepkg:object:bjet", "hepkg:object:electron", "hepkg:object:jet", "hepkg:object:lepton", "hepkg:object:missing_et", "hepkg:object:muon", "hepkg:object:primary_vertex", "jet", "lepton", "miss", "missing", "momentum", "muon", "primary", "result_defines_object", "transverse", "vertex"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9047, "completion_tokens": 307, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 11.382431323174387, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 11.382431323174387, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9354.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 7.0, "evidence_quotes": 7.0}}
{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-59f9207a", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2107.12553 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2107.12553 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- **Signal Regions**: 12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in \\(N_H\\), \\(N_{\\text{jets}}\\), and \\(p_T^{\\text{miss}}\\) (Table 8).\n- **Preselection Region**: Baseline preselection common to all signal regions (Table 6).\n- **W+jets Control Region**: MB/BDT-CRW (W+jets control region).\n- **Top Quark Validation Region**: Top quark background validation region (\\(m_{bb} > 150 \\, \\text{GeV}\\) sideband).\n- **Top Quark Control Region**: Top quark control region (inverted low-\\(m_{CT}\\) sideband).\n\nThese regions are used to define the selection criteria and validate the background estimates in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2107.12553", "2508.13900"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2107.12553"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:cr-top", "hepkg:region:cr-w", "hepkg:region:preselection", "hepkg:region:signal-regions", "hepkg:region:vr-top"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0ee2cb2526842a9fa9a8f78f", "hepkg:evidence:2395712ef9a876304feb0b28", "hepkg:evidence:547c6a6f78ae8ea54e39f0dc", "hepkg:evidence:7ccfa8375acc9d910c7f808a"], "seen_values": ["12", "15", "150", "2107.12553", "6", "8", "all", "background", "baseline", "bdt-crw", "categorized", "channel_has_region", "common", "control", "event_region", "gev", "hepkg:region:cr-top", "hepkg:region:cr-w", "hepkg:region:preselection", "hepkg:region:signal-regions", "hepkg:region:vr-t