{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-5a441cb1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many physics processes does analysis 2307.01094 target?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2307.01094 targets 2 physics processes: Gluino pair production and Squark–antisquark pair production ($\\tilde{q}\\tilde{q}^{*}$, q=u,d,s,c).", "answered": true, "papers": ["2010.14293", "2307.01094"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2307.01094"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.018}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:gluino-pair-production", "hepkg:process:squark-antisquark-pair-production"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:e93be8cba90a67a7362f6401", "hepkg:evidence:fd22217ead26bd4b17daeee6"], "seen_values": ["2307.01094", "antisquark", "gluino", "hepkg:process:gluino-pair-production", "hepkg:process:squark-antisquark-pair-production", "pair", "physics_process", "production", "result_targets_process", "squark", "tilde"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 8809, "completion_tokens": 274, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 10.563893130980432, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 10.563893130980432, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9083.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 2.0, "evidence_quotes": 2.0}}
{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-5aa448b5", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many simulated samples does analysis 2110.11231 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2110.11231 uses 11 simulated samples:\n\n- Alternative WZ signal sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, FxFx merging, NLO QCD, up to 1 extra parton)\n- Drell-Yan comparison sample, not used as background estimate (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, LO QCD)\n- Electroweak WZ production sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, LO QCD)\n- Gluon-gluon loop-induced WW/ZZ background sample (MCFM v7.0, LO QCD, scaled to NLO by 1.7)\n- Nominal WZ signal sample (POWHEG BOX v2.0, NLO QCD)\n- Other diboson background sample (Zγ, Wγ, ZH, WH) (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, NLO QCD)\n- Triboson background sample (WWW, WWZ, WZZ, ZZZ, WZγ) (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, NLO QCD)\n- WZ aTGC-reweighted sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, LO QCD)\n- qq-initiated WW and ZZ background sample (POWHEG, NLO QCD)\n- ttX background sample (tttt, ttW, ttZ, ttH, ttγ, tZq) (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, NLO QCD)\n- ttbar comparison sample, not used as background estimate (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, LO QCD)\n\nThis information is based on the content of the paper 2110.11231.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2110.11231 uses 11 simulated samples, including alternative WZ signal, Drell-Yan comparison, electroweak WZ production, gluon-gluon loop-induced WW/ZZ, nominal WZ signal, other diboson, triboson, WZ aTGC-reweighted, qq-initiated WW and ZZ, ttX, and ttbar comparison samples.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2110.11231"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2110.11231"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.042}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:drelly