{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-5eb95507", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many observables does analysis 2302.05225 measure?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2302.05225 measures 5 observables:\n\n- Branching ratio \\( B(H \\rightarrow e \\tau) \\)\n- Branching ratio \\( B(H \\rightarrow \\mu \\tau) \\)\n- Branching ratio difference \\( B(H \\rightarrow \\mu \\tau) - B(H \\rightarrow e \\tau) \\)\n- Combined LFV Yukawa coupling \\( \\sqrt{|Y_{\\tau e}|^2 + |Y_{e \\tau}|^2} \\)\n- Combined LFV Yukawa coupling \\( \\sqrt{|Y_{\\tau \\mu}|^2 + |Y_{\\mu \\tau}|^2} \\)\n\nThese observables are recorded in the graph as being measured by this analysis.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2302.05225 measures 5 observables:\\n\\n- Branching ratio \\( B(H \\\\rightarrow e \\\\tau) \\)\\n- Branching ratio \\( B(H \\\\rightarrow \\\\mu \\\\tau) \\)\\n- Branching ratio difference \\( B(H \\\\rightarrow \\\\mu \\\\tau) - B(H \\\\rightarrow e \\\\tau) \\)\\n- Combined LFV Yukawa coupling \\( \\\\sqrt{|Y_{\\\\tau e}|^2 + |Y_{e \\\\tau}|^2} \\)\\n- Combined LFV Yukawa coupling \\( \\\\sqrt{|Y_{\\\\tau \\\\mu}|^2 + |Y_{\\\\mu \\\\tau}|^2} \\)\\n\\nThese observables are recorded in the graph as being measured by this analysis.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2302.05225"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2302.05225"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.062}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:br_diff_mutau_etau", "hepkg:observable:br_h_etau", "hepkg:observable:br_h_mutau", "hepkg:observable:coupling_e_tau", "hepkg:observable:coupling_mu_tau"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:05b735b2447c7d3e68a25e3c