{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-5ecdfef1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which systematic uncertainties does analysis 2103.04956 report?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2103.04956 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\n\n- H→4l branching fraction uncertainty\n- Hadronization and underlying event modeling uncertainty\n- Integrated luminosity uncertainty\n- Jet energy resolution uncertainty\n- Jet energy scale (JES) uncertainty (7 independent sources)\n- Lepton momentum resolution uncertainty\n- Lepton momentum scale uncertainty\n- Lepton reconstruction and selection efficiency uncertainty\n- PDF set choice uncertainty\n- Reducible background (Z+X) estimation uncertainty\n- Renormalization and factorization scale uncertainty\n- Theoretical uncertainty scheme (THU) for VBF and VH STXS predictions\n- Theoretical uncertainty scheme (THU) for ggH STXS predictions\n- b tagging efficiency and misidentification correction uncertainty\n- gg→ZZ K factor uncertainty\n\nThese uncertainties are documented in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2103.04956"], "predicate": "result_has_systematic"}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "seconds": 0.049}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:systematic:branching_fraction_h4l", "hepkg:systematic:btag_efficiency", "hepkg:systematic:ggzz_kfactor", "hepkg:systematic:hadroni