ge asymmetry $A_{\\mathrm{C}}^{\\mathrm{rel}}$ vs $H_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\mathrm{jet}}$\n- Relative charge asymmetry $A_{\\mathrm{C}}^{\\mathrm{rel}}$ vs $H_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\mathrm{lep}}$\n- Relative charge asymmetry $A_{\\mathrm{C}}^{\\mathrm{rel}}$ vs $N_{\\mathrm{jets}}$\n- Relative charge asymmetry $A_{\\mathrm{C}}^{\\mathrm{rel}}$ vs $\\Delta R_{\\ell b,\\,\\textrm{lead}}$\n- Relative charge asymmetry $A_{\\mathrm{C}}^{\\mathrm{rel}}$ vs $|\\Delta\\eta_{\\ell\\ell,\\,\\textrm{SS}}|$\n- Relative charge asymmetry $A_{\\mathrm{C}}^{\\mathrm{rel}}$ vs $|\\Delta\\phi_{\\ell\\ell,\\,\\textrm{SS}}|$\n\nThis list is based on the information recorded in the graph for this analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2401.05299"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2401.05299"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 24, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:acrel-detall", "hepkg:observable:acrel-dphill", "hepkg:observable:acrel-drlb", "hepkg:observable:acrel-htjet", "hepkg:observable:acrel-htlep", "hepkg:observable:acrel-inclusive", "hepkg:observable:acrel-njets", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-detall-abs", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-detall-norm", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-dphill-abs", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-dphill-norm", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-drlb-abs", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-drlb-norm", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-htjet-abs", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-htjet-norm", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-htlep-abs", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-htlep-norm", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-njets-abs", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-njets-norm", "hepkg:observable:r-ttw", "hepkg:observable:ttw-fiducial-xsec", "hepkg:observable:ttw-inclusive-xsec", "hepkg:observable:ttw-minus-xsec", "hepkg:observable:ttw-plus-xsec"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:09e91a0dc2493a9be372dacd", "hepkg:evidence:0b91937542e85d4699cc6a91", "hepkg:evidence:28b617ec758d6187f7fccd4e", "hepkg:evidence:378