{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-61a192fe", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which background-estimation methods does analysis 2211.08028 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2211.08028 uses the following background-estimation methods:\n\n- **CLs prescription for 95% CL exclusion limits**\n- **Likelihood with Poisson-distributed yields and Gaussian-constrained nuisance parameters for systematics**\n- **Model-dependent fit (signal yield and CR signal contamination included)**\n- **Model-independent fit (BSM signal-strength parameter in SR, background from CRs) for visible cross-section limits**\n- **Profile likelihood background-only fit implemented in HistFitter**\n- **Pseudo-experiment-based calculation of limits and discovery p-values**\n\nThese methods are used to estimate the background and set limits on the signal.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2006.05880", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2106.01676", "2211.08028"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2211.08028"], "predicate": "result_uses_statistical_method"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:method:cls-prescription", "hepkg:method:model-dependent-fit", "hepkg:method:model-independent-fit", "hepkg:method:poisson-gaussian-nuisance-fit", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit-histfitter", "hepkg:method:pseudo-experiments"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:9ef0e18d131c468d1ca5d4f9", "hepkg:evidence:b2ff8ea7d2c28fd6d8100caf", "hepkg:evidence:d58b3dbe07beede68bb9c3ed", "hepkg:evidence:dbd3b19539352d97d1fff34e", "hepkg:evidence:fd7126874d700a55896e32d7", "hepkg:evidence:fdfb4ef93e5317a34597390e"], "seen_values": ["2211.08028", "95", "and", "background", "background-only", "bsm", "calculation", "cls", "contamination", "cross-section", "crs", "discovery",