{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-6368e671", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which systematic uncertainties does analysis 2504.13081 report?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2504.13081 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\n\n1. **2.1% theoretical uncertainty** applied to non-ggH production contributions in the kappa-framework fit.\n2. **Correlated experimental systematics**: integrated luminosity, pileup, jet energy scale/resolution, b tagging.\n3. **Lepton (e/mu/tau_h) energy scale and efficiency uncertainties**, uncorrelated across analyses.\n4. **Renormalization and factorization scale uncertainty** on acceptance for extrapolation to full phase space.\n5. **Theoretical uncertainty on the total Higgs boson production cross section**, summed in quadrature with shape uncertainties.\n\nThese uncertainties are documented in the paper.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2504.13081"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2504.13081"], "predicate": "result_has_systematic"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.044}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:systematic:extrapolation-scale-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:lepton-energy-scale-efficiency-uncorrelated", "hepkg:systematic:luminosity-pileup-jes-jer-btag", "hepkg:systematic:non-ggh-theory-2p1pct", "hepkg:systematic:total-xsec-theory-uncertainty"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:1face6b09253a92d79539f1a", "hepkg:evidence:7a1aee3dc292b7491d9f2fb8", "hepkg:evidence:8ab8648205c7fd429a6044bb", "hepkg:evidence:99fba61c1d87d6ce1a8fc141", "hepkg:evidence:e5c93fb5aa79d35fa58375be"], "seen_values": ["19", "2.1", "2504.13081", "acceptance", "across", "analyses", "and", "applied", "boson", "contributions", "correlated", "cross", "efficiency", "energy", "experimental", "extrapolation", "factorization", "f