{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-63ddf6f0", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many systematic uncertainties does analysis 2401.05299 report?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2401.05299 reports 19 systematic uncertainties:\n\n- $b$-/$c$-/light-flavour tagging efficiency uncertainty\n- $t\\bar{t}W$ ME/PS generator-choice modelling uncertainty\n- $t\\bar{t}W$ PDF/$\\alpha_{s}$ uncertainty\n- $t\\bar{t}W$ parton-shower modelling uncertainty (Powheg+Pythia8 vs Powheg+Herwig7)\n- $t\\bar{t}W$ renormalisation/factorisation scale uncertainty\n- Charge misidentification background uncertainty\n- Electron/photon reconstruction, identification, isolation uncertainty\n- Fakes/$VV$/$t\\bar{t}Z$ normalisation-factor uncertainty (free to vary in fit)\n- Integrated luminosity uncertainty\n- Jet energy resolution (JER) uncertainty\n- Jet energy scale uncertainty\n- Limited MC simulation sample-size statistical uncertainty\n- Missing transverse momentum ($E_{T}^{miss}$) uncertainty\n- Muon reconstruction, identification, isolation uncertainty\n- Non-prompt-lepton BDT / lepton isolation BDT calibration uncertainty\n- Non-prompt-lepton background modelling uncertainty (HF/conversion)\n- Pileup modeling uncertainty\n- Prompt-lepton background modelling uncertainty ($t\\bar{t}H$ ISR/ME/PS, $t\\bar{t}Z$ and $VV$ scale/PS)\n- Prompt-lepton background normalisation uncertainty (dominated by $t\\bar{t}H$ and $t\\bar{t}t\\bar{t}$)\n- Trigger efficiency uncertainty\n\nThis list is based on the systematic uncertainties explicitly recorded in the graph for this analysis. \n\nAnswered from the graph.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2401.05299 reports 19 systematic uncertainties, including $b$-/$c$-/light-flavour tagging efficiency uncertainty, $t\\\\bar{t}W$ ME/PS generator-choice modelling uncertainty, and others. The full list is provided above.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2510.07527", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2401.05299"], "predicate": "result_has_systematic"}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "seconds": 0.048}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:systematic:charge-misid", "hepkg:systematic:electron-photon-reconstruction", "hepkg:systematic:fakes-vv-ttz-norm", "hepkg:systematic:flavour-tagging", "hepkg:systematic:jet-energy-resolution", "hepkg:systematic:jet-energy-scale", "hepkg:systematic:luminosity", "hepkg:systematic:mc-statistics", "hepkg:systematic:met-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:muon-reconstruction", "hepkg:systematic:nonprompt-lepton-bdt-calibration", "hepkg:systematic:nonprompt-lepton-bkg-modelling", "hepkg:systematic:pileup", "hepkg:systematic:prompt-lepton-bkg-modelling", "hepkg:systematic:prompt-lepton-bkg-norm", "hepkg:systematic:trigger", "hepkg:systematic:ttw-me-modelling", "hepkg:systematic:ttw-pdf", "hepkg:systematic:ttw-ps-modelling", "hepkg:systematic:ttw-scale"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0e2f6835f62b05546ebb3812", "hepkg:evidence:0f12575424ec04cbcad355fe", "hepkg:evidence:16c7fa471a0f7b716c011fa3", "hepkg:evidence:1e6100e94f35c053f739718c", "hepkg:evidence:21f5501cafcfe060c235aba5", "hepkg:evidence:23b00bb9e974b0edc0e6214f", "hepkg:evidence:27bbdebb383560e5019328f3", "hepkg:evidence:2f39db3b0b0eaf0be95d1449", "hepkg:evidence:36a1c80644824353c99f22d3", "hepkg:evi