{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-652d854a", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many region selection requirements does analysis 2405.18661 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2405.18661 defines 24 region selection requirements:\n\n- \"105 < m(4l) < 160 GeV\"\n- \"12 < m(Z2) < 120 GeV\"\n- \"40 < m(Z1) < 120 GeV\"\n- \"Higgs transverse mass m_T^H > 60 GeV\"\n- \"cross section computed with jet veto applied\"\n- \"dilepton mass m(ll) > 12 GeV\"\n- \"exactly one electron and one muon in the final state\"\n- \"generator-level photon isolation < 10 GeV\"\n- \"jet pT > 133 GeV and |y| < 2.0\"\n- \"leading lepton pT > 20 GeV\"\n- \"leading lepton pT > 25 GeV\"\n- \"leading photon pT/m(gg) > 1/3\"\n- \"lepton pT > 20 GeV for single-W boson analyses\"\n- \"lepton pT > 20(25) GeV in e-tau_h (mu-tau_h) channel\"\n- \"second lepton pT > 10 GeV, additional leptons pT > 5 GeV\"\n- \"selection via MET or large transverse mass\"\n- \"single-lepton final state\"\n- \"subleading lepton pT > 10 GeV\"\n- \"subleading lepton pT > 13 GeV\"\n- \"subleading photon pT/m(gg) > 1/4\"\n- \"transverse mass m_T(lepton, MET) < 50 GeV\"\n- \"two jets and one b jet\"\n- \"up to two b jets, categorized by additional jet multiplicity\"\n- \"visible tau_h pT > 30 GeV\"\n- \"|eta(photon)| < 2.5\"\n\nThis list is based on the selections recorded in the graph for this analysis. \n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2405.18661"], "predicate": "region_has_selection"}, "rows": 25, "error": null, "seconds": 0.072}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:183fdaf540387fb676f492fa", "hepkg:evidence:1b93ae1e712d7034be293c59", "hepkg:evidence:24c13a678b4832907843d0b1", "hepkg:evidence:26e74065c3b0b0c5c52e