{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-65c23552", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2001.06899 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2001.06899 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- High-purity ttbar control region for b jet M_SV template (lepton+≥2 jets, ≥1 b-tagged jet)\n- Particle-level fiducial phase space\n- Semileptonic ttbar validation sample for c jet M_SV template (muon+≥4 jets)\n- W+jets validation sample for light-jet M_SV template (muon+≥1 jet)\n- Z+HF jets sample (HF-tagged region)\n- Z+jets baseline selection region\n\nThese regions are used to define the selection criteria for different parts of the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2001.06899"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "seconds": 0.032}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:fiducial_particle_level", "hepkg:region:ttbar_bjet_template_cr", "hepkg:region:ttbar_semileptonic_c_template_cr", "hepkg:region:wjets_light_template_cr", "hepkg:region:z_plus_hf_jets", "hepkg:region:z_plus_jets_baseline"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:135db9c378c3b70e5621c664", "hepkg:evidence:404113ab2f55838c508ca55f", "hepkg:evidence:617e67299b127a74f7fa1184", "hepkg:evidence:ba227061b216f9422a20602b", "hepkg:evidence:ba6af461b8444b547387f75c", "hepkg:evidence:f2bb50f78e0e04fdc10e19eb"], "seen_values": ["1", "2", "2001.06899", "4", "b-tagged", "baseline", "channel_has_region", "control", "event_region", "fiducial", "for", "hepkg:region:fiducial_particle_level", "hepkg:region:ttbar_bjet_template_cr", "hepkg:region:ttbar_semileptonic_c_template_cr", "hepkg:region:wjets_light_template_cr", "hepkg:region:z_plus_hf_jets", "hepkg:region:z_plus_jets