{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-65e731ed", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2401.07090 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2401.07090 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- Electron channel baseline preselection (B+ mass 4.7-5.7 GeV, prior to q^2 binning)\n- High-mass sideband (5.49 < m(K ell ell) < 5.65 GeV)\n- High-q^2 region above psi(2S), electron channel (studied but excluded from final analysis)\n- J/psi control region (8.41 < q^2 < 10.24 GeV^2)\n- Low-mass sideband, electron channel (4.91 < m(K e e) < 5.07 GeV)\n- Low-mass sideband, muon channel (4.90 < m(K mu mu) < 5.07 GeV)\n- Low-q^2 signal region (1.1 < q^2 < 6.0 GeV^2, K+ell ell mass 5.07-5.49 GeV)\n- Muon channel baseline preselection (B+ mass 5.0-5.6 GeV, prior to q^2 binning)\n- Same-sign lepton control region (SR selection with inverted OS requirement, used for BDT background)\n- psi(2S) control region (12.6 < q^2 < 14.44 GeV^2)\n\nThese regions are part of the analysis and are used for various selections and control purposes.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2401.07090 contains the following event regions in its channels:\\n\\n- Electron channel baseline preselection (B+ mass 4.7-5.7 GeV, prior to q^2 binning)\\n- High-mass sideband (5.49 < m(K ell ell) < 5.65 GeV)\\n- High-q^2 region above psi(2S), electron channel (studied but excluded from final analysis)\\n- J/psi control region (8.41 < q^2 < 10.24 GeV^2)\\n- Low-mass sideband, electron channel (4.91 < m(K e e) < 5.07 GeV)\\n- Low-mass sideband, muon channel (4.90 < m(K mu mu) < 5.07 GeV)\\n- Low-q^2 signal region (1.1 < q^2 < 6.0 GeV^2, K+ell ell mass 5.07-5.49 GeV)\\n- Muon channel baseline preselection (B+ mass 5.0-5.6 GeV, prior to q^2 binning)\\n- Same-sign lepton control region (SR selection with inverted OS requirement, used for BDT background)\\n- psi(2S) control region (12.6 < q^2 < 14.44 GeV^2)\\n\\nThese regions are part of the analysis and are used for various selections and control purposes.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}", "answered": true, "papers": ["2401.07090"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2401.07090"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:high_mass_sb", "hepkg:region:high_q2_electron_excluded", "hepkg:region:jpsi_cr", "hepkg:region:low_mass_sb_electron", "hepkg:region:low_mass_sb_muon", "hepkg:region:low_q2_sr", "hepkg:region:preselection_electron", "hepkg:region:preselection_muon", "hepkg:region:psi2s_cr", "hepkg:region:same_sign_cr"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:279ab5bcbfee63a1d30e3a39", "hepkg:evidence:3127880a58346a60ffa5d0ac", "hepkg:evidence:362c6696efaec4ccbd58c4db", "hepkg:evidence:67e1a4159954b1102bb396f2", "hepkg:evidence:7da5a98a46ca36b865f7e8cb", "hepkg:evidence:e8aea39c58e08eab6772ad3d", "hepkg:evidence:ee4920de8be800fbc94fe4c2"], "seen_values": ["1.1", "10.24", "12.6", "14.44", "2", "2401.0709", "2401.07090", "4.7", "4.9", "4.90", "4.91", "5", "5.0", "5.07", "5.49", "5.6", "5.65", "5.7", "6", "6.0", "8.41", "above", "analysis", "background", "baseline", "bdt", "binning", "but", "channel", "channel_has_region", "control", "electron", "ell", "event_region", "excluded", "final", "for", "from", "gev", "hepkg:region:high_mass_sb", "hepkg:region:high_q2_electron_excluded", "hepkg:region:jpsi_cr", "hepkg:region:low_mass_sb_electron", "hepkg:region:low_mass_sb_muon", "hepkg:region:low_q2_sr", "hepkg:region:preselection_electron", "hepkg:region:preselection_muon", "hepkg:region:psi2s_cr", "hepkg:region:same_sign_cr", "high-mass", "high-q", "inverted", "lepton", "low-mass", "low-q", "mass", "muon", "preselection", "prior", "ps