{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-6897bbe0", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2109.13808 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2109.13808 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- Top control region (VBF analysis)\n- Top control region (ggF + 2 jets analysis)\n- VBF signal region\n- WW control region (ggF + 2 jets analysis)\n- Z→ττ control region (VBF analysis)\n- Z→ττ control region (ggF + 2 jets analysis)\n- ggF + 2 jets signal region\n\nThese regions are part of the different channels used in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2109.13808"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2109.13808"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "seconds": 0.051}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:ggf2jets_sr", "hepkg:region:ggf2jets_top_cr", "hepkg:region:ggf2jets_ww_cr", "hepkg:region:ggf2jets_ztautau_cr", "hepkg:region:vbf_sr", "hepkg:region:vbf_top_cr", "hepkg:region:vbf_ztautau_cr"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:2b99b548a2121a6294a73766", "hepkg:evidence:318f0c9d36086e1027a96c9b", "hepkg:evidence:76ed361e6215dadf93a9fdf1"], "seen_values": ["2", "2109.13808", "analysis", "channel_has_region", "control", "event_region", "ggf", "hepkg:region:ggf2jets_sr", "hepkg:region:ggf2jets_top_cr", "hepkg:region:ggf2jets_ww_cr", "hepkg:region:ggf2jets_ztautau_cr", "hepkg:region:vbf_sr", "hepkg:region:vbf_top_cr", "hepkg:region:vbf_ztautau_cr", "jets", "region", "signal", "tautau", "top", "vbf"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9108, "completion_tokens": 153, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 7.556504974141717, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 7.556504974141717, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9261.0, "rounds": 2.0, "e