{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-68a63983", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2012.01581 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2012.01581 measures the following observables:\n\n- 95% CL exclusion limit on gluino/top-squark mass as a function of mean proper decay length\n- 95% CL upper limit on LLP pair production cross section\n- 95% CL upper limit on branching fraction of SM-like Higgs boson to two long-lived scalar particles", "answered": true, "papers": ["2012.01581"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2012.01581"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:higgs_br_ul", "hepkg:observable:llp_mass_exclusion_limit", "hepkg:observable:pair_production_cross_section_ul"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:104565d247f69631012d1150", "hepkg:evidence:4b689d2927aa533f3d8befb9", "hepkg:evidence:4c49ce1f0448f40ecbf32917", "hepkg:evidence:88c97278475bc50386f1c50d", "hepkg:evidence:c32553f56405c11c0fb1dd56", "hepkg:evidence:d82881bb85805d28153f7b5f", "hepkg:evidence:dc32fda856c72c452dfda338", "hepkg:evidence:fadbe46181788a2bf6155713"], "seen_values": ["2012.01581", "95", "boson", "branching", "cross", "decay", "exclusion", "fraction", "function", "gluino", "hepkg:observable:higgs_br_ul", "hepkg:observable:llp_mass_exclusion_limit", "hepkg:observable:pair_production_cross_section_ul", "higgs", "length", "limit", "llp", "long-lived", "mass", "mean", "observable", "pair", "particles", "production", "proper", "result_measures_observable", "scalar", "section", "sm-like", "top-squark", "two", "upper"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 8882, "completion_tokens": 321, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 11.94315353827551, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 11.94315353827551, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9203.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "retrieved_label_recall": 1.0, "retrieved_entities": 3.0, "mentioned_label_recall": 1.0, "truncation_loss_labels": 0.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 3.0, "evidence_quotes": 8.0}}
{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-68b9930c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2202.08676 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2202.08676 defines 18 object selection requirements. Here they are:\n\n1. \"3D impact parameter significance < 10 (2016), 12 (2017), 9 (2018)\"\n2. \"DeepCSV medium working point b-tagging\"\n3. \"DeepTau discriminant against jets, electrons, muons\"\n4. \"barrel: |dz|<0.1 cm, |dxy|<0.05 cm; endcap: |dz|<0.2 cm, |dxy|<0.1 cm\"\n5. \"electron discarded if a b-tagged jet (pT>10 GeV, |eta|<2.5) found within DeltaR<0.4\"\n6. \"electrons within DeltaR<0.05 of a selected muon are discarded\"\n7. \"h candidates within DeltaR<0.5 of a selected electron or muon are discarded\"\n8. \"identification efficiency 60-75% for b quark jets, ~10% mistag c, ~1% mistag light/gluon\"\n9. \"jets outside DeltaR=0.4 cone around a selected muon, electron, or tau_h candidate\"\n10. \"medium cut-based ID (shower shape and track quality requirements)\"\n11. \"muon discarded if a b-tagged jet (pT>10 GeV, |eta|<2.5) found within DeltaR<0.4\"\n12. \"pT > 10 GeV, |eta| < 2.4\"\n13. \"pT > 20 GeV, |eta| < 2.3\"\n14. \"pT > 30 GeV, |eta| < 2.4\"\n15. \"relative isolation < 0.0478+0.506 GeV/pT (barrel, |eta|<1.479) or < 0.0658+0.963 GeV/pT (endcap, |eta|>1.479), DeltaR=0.3\"\n16. \"relative isolation < 0.15, DeltaR=0.4\"\n17. \"|dz| < 0.2 cm\"\n18. \"|dz|<0.1 cm, |dxy|<0.05 cm\"\n\nThese selections are recorded in the paper 2202.08676.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2202.08676 defines 18 object selection requirements. These include criteria for b-tagging, electron and muon isolation, and jet selection, among others.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers":