{"run_id": "20260814T113003-hepkg-48426", "qid": "gen-paper-6b007244", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "f506821-dirty", "question": "Which physics processes does analysis 2112.03161 target?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2112.03161 targets the following physics processes:\n\n- \\( HH \\rightarrow bb WW^* \\rightarrow bb l l \\nu \\nu \\) (dilepton)\n- \\( HH \\rightarrow bb WW^* \\rightarrow bb l \\nu qq' \\) (single-lepton)\n- \\( HH \\rightarrow bb ZZ^* \\) (minor contribution, included in acceptance)\n- \\( HH \\rightarrow bb \\tau \\tau \\rightarrow bb l l \\nu \\nu \\nu \\nu \\) (dilepton)\n- \\( pp \\rightarrow X \\rightarrow HH \\) (generic heavy resonance to Higgs pair)\n\nThese processes are the specific decays and production mechanisms that the analysis aims to study.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2112.03161"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2112.03161"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.019}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:HH_bbWW_llnunu", "hepkg:process:HH_bbWW_lnuqq", "hepkg:process:HH_bbZZ", "hepkg:process:HH_bbtautau_llnunu", "hepkg:process:pp_X_HH_generic"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:05929a47498e2f383f9d2ba7", "hepkg:evidence:19cfd2d0ee485aa8ea3b61f7", "hepkg:evidence:57d8fd9c2f63003cc3216a9d", "hepkg:evidence:6f8f10ef392f568817d8ef64", "hepkg:evidence:cbf1ee673ed29f18aaa92497"], "seen_values": ["2112.03161", "acceptance", "contribution", "dilepton", "generic", "heavy", "hepkg:process:hh_bbtautau_llnunu", "hepkg:process:hh_bbww_llnunu", "hepkg:process:hh_bbww_lnuqq", "hepkg:process:hh_bbzz", "hepkg:process:pp_x_hh_generic", "higgs", "included", "minor", "pair", "physics_process", "resonance", "result_targets_process", "single-lepton", "tau"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prom